{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1496929-ctl2e-ic-lambry-county-montana","id":1496929,"title":"[CtL2e-IC]Lambry County, Montana","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play","Play by Post"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-11-12T12:23:48-08:00","id":1496929,"title":"[CtL2e-IC]Lambry County, Montana","content":"<i>It is a snowy morning. Though he can only recall terrified bits here and there, Halwyn knows this isn\u2019t</i> true <i>cold, but rather a pale facsimile. His trailer is a bundle of warmth, and crawling out of bed seems a crime against nature.<br /> <br /> Nevertheless, his cellphone rings. It\u2019s Marcy, his mortal boss. Marcy was a good woman. Utterly ignorant of the horrid supernatural truths of the world, but her heart was good and true...if a bit rough around the edges</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-12T14:09:37-08:00","id":1496933,"title":"","content":"<i>That miserable beeping thing pulls him out of his thoughts. He reaches for his phone and is happy inside that he has now learned not to accidentally press the wrong button or even hang up immediately.</i><br /> &quot;Montgomery on the line, who's speaking?&quot; <i>A slight yawn underlines his not yet fully awake state.</i> &quot;Marcy? Did I oversleep?&quot;<i> Although he was sure that he had the day off, he sat up completely and listened to her carefully. With a look out of the window he makes sure how deep the snow was before he climbs out of bed and into the bathroom. He wonders if he should take a quick shower.</i> &quot;Yes, I'm still there&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-12T14:21:55-08:00","id":1496935,"title":"","content":"Marcy sounded incredibly busy, with a lot going on in the background. \u201cNeed you to come in, honey. The new girl quit.\u201d Marcy sighs. \u201cI\u2019m sorry, Hal, I really am.\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-12T14:41:19-08:00","id":1496938,"title":"","content":"&quot;Don't worry, I'll be there in half an hour,&quot; he snorts. He wasn't convinced of the new girl from the start, but he hadn't thought that she would just quit like that.<br /> He sniffs at himself and wrinkles his nose. &quot;Let's say 45 minutes, okay?&quot; Before he hangs up, he turns on the shower. &quot;See you soon my dear&quot;<br /> He throws the cell phone on his bed and climbs into the warm water. A few minutes later, he actually doesn't want to go out at all, he puts on his clothes and checks again whether he has everything with him. <br /> In front of the door of his caravan he shakes himself again. Winter, snow and cold\u2026 he didn't like any of that, his memories, though weak, stung him like shattered ice crystals. He left his car, which had been playing around all day because of the weather, so he set off on foot.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-12T15:10:51-08:00","id":1496939,"title":"","content":"Pulling in to Marcy\u2019s Diner, he can see through the front window how busy it is. No wonder Marcy called Halwyn in.<br /> <br /> As he enters the diner, he spots Old Man Scratch. Halwyn effortlessly sees below the Mask, and Old Man Scratch\u2019s bovine features shine through. In his youth, Scratch had been the very stereotypical iteration of the classical minotaur, but age covers him like a shroud. His muscles have begun to turn to flab, his horns badly chipped, his beard iron grey colored. As usual, he sits alone. He makes mortals...nervous.<br /> <br /> Marcy, short, fat and still wearing a beehive hairdo like out of the 1950s meets Halwyn as he goes into the back. She follows him in. \u201cOh, Hal,\u201d she mentions, \u201cSome guy was in here an hour ago askin\u2019 about you. I didn\u2019t tell him squat.\u201d She arches an eyebrow. \u201cYou in trouble of some sort?\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-12T15:27:12-08:00","id":1496942,"title":"","content":"A quick nod towards Old Man Scratch, the man always reminding him of Minos, the first changeling he'd met and without whom he wouldn't be here, then he turns to Marcy. &quot;I have no idea&quot; he scratches the back of his head as he thinks about it. &quot;What did the guy look like? Although,... tell me about it when we have some time. Where should I start with the work?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-12T15:51:31-08:00","id":1496945,"title":"","content":"She points at the grills. \u201cPeople gotta eat.<br /> <br /> \u201cAs to what the guy looked like, I dunno...kinda gave me \u2018cop\u2019 vibes, but I didn\u2019t see no badge or anything.\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-12T22:37:26-08:00","id":1496963,"title":"","content":"&quot;All right, boss!&quot; He salutes briefly with a smile, goes to the grill and checks which orders have already been taken. &quot;Who could this guy be?&quot; he ponders, mumbling. He hadn't done anything, at least nothing that he was aware of. Or maybe he had?<br /> <br /> The ringing of the next order pulls him out of his thoughts and he concentrates fully on the job. There will be time later to think about it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-13T09:04:35-08:00","id":1496979,"title":"","content":"Hours go by. As the day progresses, individual members of the freehold drift in to eat, then leave as quietly as they came in. Except Old Man Scratch. He sits there all day, before, at 2 pm, getting up and leaving. He ate like a horse (a common denominator among minotaurs, it seems), but left behind a scrap of paper.<br /> <br /> Marcy eventually gets the paper, and brings it back into the kitchen. She patiently waits for Halwyn to finish what he\u2019s doing, then hands him the paper. \u201cThat ol\u2019 Devlin guy\u2014-the one who looks homeless?\u2014-left <i>this</i> instead of a tip.\u201d She hands to the Ogre. \u201cKnow what it might be about?\u201d<br /> <br /> As Halwyn opens the note, in tense, scribbled handwriting, it says, <i>Got to go. Caught my scent.</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-13T09:21:01-08:00","id":1496981,"title":"","content":"Halwyn reads this short message over and over again. &quot;Hmm...I don't know exactly. But he seems a bit confused or scared. Have you seen where he went? I'm a little worried about him.&quot; He doesn't even have to play that concern which you can clearly see in his eyes. His gaze darts through the window, hoping he might still see Old Man Scratch.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-13T09:47:49-08:00","id":1496982,"title":"","content":"Marcy shrugged. \u201cSaid somethin\u2019 \u2018bout family comin\u2019 in. Didn\u2019t seem happy \u2018bout it, either. Never thought Devlin even <i>had</i> family...<br /> <br /> \u201cAs to where he went? No clue. He\u2019s drivin\u2019 that godawful Winnebago of his. Y\u2019know, the one that probably hadn\u2019t seen a car wash in thirty years?\u201d<br /> <br /> Outside, a gentle snowfall resumes. Old Man Scratch is nowhere in sight.<br /> <br /> Marcy shrugs again. \u201cEh, whatever he\u2019s got himself into, Devlin\u2019ll figure it out on his own, I guess; he always does.\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-13T10:26:11-08:00","id":1496986,"title":"","content":"He shrugs. &quot;Not everyone gets along with their family&quot; something he can understand very well. <br /> The falling snow will make it difficult for him to follow Scratch if he stays here any longer. &quot;Do you still need me today?&quot; He tries not to sound too urgent.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-13T10:42:51-08:00","id":1496988,"title":"","content":"Marcy shakes her head no. \u201cPlace is slowin\u2019 down. Roads might be problematic.\u201d She waves a hand. \u201cGo home, Hal. Stay warm.\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-13T11:03:34-08:00","id":1496989,"title":"","content":"&quot;I will&quot; he nods. He grabbed his things quickly. &quot;I'll see you tomorrow, don't stress yourself too much&quot;. <br /> <br /> Outside he looks around again to see if the Winnebago is still standing somewhere. <br /> The cold forces him to close his jacket, something he has never done before. <br /> &quot;Didn't Scratch have closer contact with Damian?&quot; he murmurs. &quot;maybe...&quot; he reaches for his phone and notebook to find Damian's number. He knows that he can also save the numbers in the small glass box, but he still hasn't managed to do it. He dials the number and waits for the boy to answer.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-13T11:06:47-08:00","id":1496991,"title":"","content":"The voice on the other end is half-asleep. \u201cWhu...who\u2019s this? Fuck man, I was sleeping.\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-13T11:10:55-08:00","id":1496995,"title":"","content":"&quot;It's me, hellhound. I didn't mean to wake you up, but do you know where Scratch might be? He seems to be having problems.&quot; Halwyn's voice trembles slightly from the cold.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-13T11:28:23-08:00","id":1496998,"title":"","content":"\u201cNnh? Yeah...he\u2019s been a bit weird, lately. He\u2019s been...a <i>lot</i> more paranoid than normal.\u201d Halwyn can hear Damien sit up in bed. \u201cI haven\u2019t seen anything suspicious, but maybe he thinks...I dunno, man. Look, you might find him down by Juniper Lake. He goes there to think, a lot.\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-13T11:42:41-08:00","id":1497000,"title":"","content":"&quot;In the diner he said something about his family, my boss says. And he left a note that said&quot; he clears his throat &quot;Got to go. Caught my scent. Do you know anything about it?&quot; He is already on his way to his car, hoping that he can start it. &quot;Juniper Lake? Thanks, I'll take a look around. Please let me know if you notice anything.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-13T11:56:59-08:00","id":1497001,"title":"","content":"The voice on the other end sounded...defeated, almost. \u201cNo clue what it means. Look, Hellhound, Imma go back to bed.\u201d And the boy hangs up.<br /> <br /> It is a slow, peaceful drive to Juniper Lake. A scenic locale popular with tourists, winter has laid it barren of visitors. But, thankfully, Halwyn can see Scratch\u2019s Winnebago down by the shore. Scratch himself stands at the shore, smoking a cigarette.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-13T12:14:01-08:00","id":1497003,"title":"","content":"&quot;Well then, sleep...&quot; he looks at his phone when he hears the disconnected tone &quot;...well...&quot; shaking his head he puts his phone in his pocket. <br /> <br /> He parks his car nearby, looks around briefly and then goes to Scratch. &quot;Hey, I got your message...&quot; he calls out to him. &quot;Who's after you?&quot; with native distance he stops.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-13T12:31:20-08:00","id":1497004,"title":"","content":"He doesn\u2019t turn around, doesn\u2019t answer. Just smokes, looking out at the lake.<br /> <br /> Finishing his cigarette, Scratch slowly starts walking towards the water, not looking anywhere but forward.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-13T12:55:44-08:00","id":1497006,"title":"","content":"&quot;Hey where are you going?&quot; Halwyn runs the remaining distance and grabs Scratch's shoulder, willing to hold him tight as well.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-13T13:01:28-08:00","id":1497008,"title":"","content":"Scratch growls, \u201cLet go a\u2019me, boy. Go fuck off.\u201d He tries to shrug Halwyn off and to continue down towards the waters. Halwyn is able to see Scratch\u2019s face, and he looks...<i>hollow</i>, somehow. \u201cGo home.\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-13T13:06:17-08:00","id":1497009,"title":"","content":"&quot;Fuck, what's the matter with you?&quot; He tightens his grip and tries to push him to his knees. &quot;Scratch something is wrong&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-13T13:19:15-08:00","id":1497011,"title":"","content":"In frustration Scratch throws his cigarette into the lake, then turns to face Halwyn.<br /> <br /> \u201cBoy, I been runnin\u2019 a <i>long</i> time. Kept movin\u2019. But...it gets hard, stayin\u2019 on the move. You start to crave <i>stability, sameness</i>. And that\u2019s when They get you. When you settle down, when everything\u2019s all good an\u2019 kosher.<br /> <br /> \u201cI...Damien\u2019s like a son, to me. Sometimes, They make you choose. Well. I ain\u2019t choosin\u2019 <i>him</i>. I chose <i>me</i>.\u201d Scratch averts his gaze. \u201cGo home, Hellhound. Just....go home.\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-13T13:38:31-08:00","id":1497013,"title":"","content":"&quot;Scratch, this is no way out. If they come, we can fight, stop them...&quot; Halwyn's voice is accompanied by a growl. <br /> &quot;If you don't want to run anymore, then stay. You're experienced. Teach us who's chasing you so we can strike.&quot;<br /> <br /> Was it right to stop him from his plan? He didn't know, but still felt it was necessary. &quot;If Damian is like a son to you then you can't just leave him.&quot; He knew this pain by himself, even if he lost his parents very early. <br /> &quot;...and when something follows you, ...don't you think it's already set its sights on the boy? So when you're gone, he's the next target?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-13T13:41:17-08:00","id":1497016,"title":"","content":"Scratch shook his head. \u201cThey promised. Me. Or him. I chose me.\u201d<br /> <br /> The snowfall thickens, and sounds mute subtly. Scratch points up at Halwyn\u2019s car. \u201cThey\u2019re comin\u2019. You still have time, son. Get in your vehicle and get the fuck away from here. They\u2019ll....be here. <i>Soon</i>.\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-13T14:07:24-08:00","id":1497017,"title":"","content":"&quot;What exactly did you decide? What was the choice? What do they want from you?&quot; <br /> As the snow thickens, Halwyn instinctively reaches for his lighter. &quot;I leave none of my pack behind?&quot; It was clearly Hellhound speaking at that moment, not Halwyn. <br /> He ignites his lighter with a flourish and holds it in front of his face. His tongue extinguishes the flame and for a moment he inhales the smell of gasoline emanating from the Zippo. As he breathes out, small clouds of ash are formed, which wrap themselves around him and start to burn. &quot;I don't have a deal with them, I will fight,&quot; he says with a deep-seated anger.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-13T14:39:51-08:00","id":1497021,"title":"","content":"Fires ignite first on Halwyn\u2019s scars, then his hair, then consume him completely. Halwyn hears a dim echo of his Arcadian pack howling on the wind, and the snow sizzles as it lands on him.<br /> <br /> Scratch sighs. \u201cYou idiot. Well, in for a penny, in for a pound.\u201d He turns back to the lake. \u201cI was standin\u2019 here a week ago, when a <i>Huntsman</i> showed. \u2018Bout shit my pants. It gave me a long stare, then flew off. I knew <i>He</i> was looking for me.<br /> <br /> \u201cI was gonna bug out, me and Damien hit the road, when a <i>wolf</i> come up outta the lake. It wasn\u2019t no hob. It wasn\u2019t even fae. It spoke to me. Called it itself a \u2018kin of tar\u2019, whatever the fuck <i>that</i> means. Damn thing came right up outta the water. Middle a\u2019winter, drippin\u2019 wet. Said to me, \u2018Make a choice. They are coming. We hunger for a heart like yours. Choose. Either you or the boy you consider your son. The one you choose must sacrifice himself. In return, the other shall be protected.<br /> <br /> \u201cI chose myself, Hellhound. That boy\u2019s basically like a son to me. I ain\u2019t lettin\u2019 no Huntsmen get him.\u201d He sighed, a terrible, defeated sound. He gazed out at the lake. \u201cThe...wolf?...will be here, soon. Too late to run, boy. <i>Much</i> too late.\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-13T15:10:16-08:00","id":1497023,"title":"","content":"&quot;If it wasn't a Hob and it wasn't a Fae...then it can't ask for such a choice, or it can.&quot; Halwyn was puzzled by what was being said. This confusion fueled his anger all the more. &quot;I don't know what a Kin of Tar is either, but I'm sure it can bleed. He sharpens his claws and also looks towards the lake. One question sticks in his mind &quot;why,...no what if you didn't decide? Were there any consequences that were pronounced?&quot; One thing he learned during the time, if a contract is not properly formulated, you can exploit enough loopholes or cancel the contract...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-13T15:47:41-08:00","id":1497027,"title":"","content":"Scratch stares out at the water. \u201cHuntsmen are comin\u2019. These...things...will watch over Damien. Otherwise, we both might get snatched up.\u201d<br /> <br /> Striding up out of the water was a wolf, soaked to the bone. It wasn\u2019t that the thing had swam ashore; rather, it had <i>walked</i> up out of the lake. It looked at Halwyn, then bared its fangs and growled. In a voice not meant for human speech, the wolf rumbled, \u201c<span style=\"color:teal\"><i>What. Is. This. An extra offering? You stupid cow, that\u2019s</i> NOT <i>our deal. It is time. Come. The others await. We will carve your name in stone, along with the debt we will owe you. Send this intruder away, cow. He\u2019s not wanted.</i></span>\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12219,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","user":"Demigod Beast","date":". 11-13-2022, 07:04 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-13T22:35:29-08:00","id":1497069,"title":"","content":"&quot;I don't think anything protects DAMIEN JUST because you SACRIFICED YOURSELF. ESPECIALLY NOT A CREATURE THAT HAS NOTHING TO DO WITH THE FAE.&quot; Each of his words grows louder, suffused with anger. <br /> And he was angry, at Scratch for making such a stupid deal, at something here playing on a man's feelings, at not knowing what's coming next, and most importantly at himself for not having a clue how he can help Scratch other than fighting alongside him or instead of him. <br /> <br /> When the wolf climbs out of the lake, he just roars at him, he heard the words but they didn't interest him. Between Scratch and the wolf-thing, he took up position, ready to strike immediately.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-14T08:50:20-08:00","id":1497094,"title":"","content":"The snow fell heavier. \u201c<span style=\"color:teal\"><i>So be it. The pact is broken. We withdraw our offer. We shall not fight, with humans coming to the lake.</i></span>\u201d It looks beyond them. \u201c<span style=\"color:teal\"><i>Fishermen have saved your lives. Be grateful.</i></span>\u201d And with, it walked back into the waters of Lake Juniper, gone from sight.<br /> <br /> Behind them, a pickup truck with shoe tires tumbled down towards the lake. Two men got out, and went to the truck\u2019s bed, unloading fishing gear. One looks at Halwyn and Scratch, waves and smiles.<br /> <br /> Scratch watches the wolf go with dismal eyes. His voice low, hushed, the old bull whispers, \u201cMaybe you were right, boy. I dunno.\u201d<br /> <br /> [OOC: You now have the \u201cShaken\u201d Condition. This Condition can be resolved by having your character deliberately fail a roll during a frightening situation. Upon doing so, gain a single Beat.]","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12219,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","user":"Demigod Beast","date":". 11-14-2022, 01:19 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-14T09:41:42-08:00","id":1497095,"title":"","content":"&quot;Damn, what the hell was that?&quot; he looks towards the fishermen and lets his flames go out before they notice. &quot;Scratch...I...&quot; <br /> Goosebumps run down his arms as his anger dissipates, definitely not from the cold. His eyes look back and forth nervously, in which the wolf.....the creature doesn't appear again somewhere. <br /> &quot;We should...should go. We have to tell the others about this thing.&quot; His voice almost cracks. Was it really wise to mess with the creature? Why did it go? Just because of a few fishermen? That can't really be,...or can it? <br /> &quot;Let's tell the Autum Court about it...maybe they know something about it.&quot; The main thing was to get away, that was his real concern, but he didn't want to show in front of Scratch.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-14T09:48:20-08:00","id":1497097,"title":"","content":"Scratch nods mutely. Then, in a small voice, he says, \u201cBluefingers, gotta find Bluefingers.\u201d<br /> <br /> This is a name Halwyn recognizes. A local Autumn fae, Bluefingers might not be the most powerful changeling in Lambry County, but she <i>is</i> the most knowledgeable. A shrunken doll under her Mask, Her fingers are needles that drip blue ink. Her library is surely something to see, though few ever get that blessing.<br /> <br /> Bluefingers lives at the House Up On The Hill. It was time to go visit the freehold...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-14T10:40:29-08:00","id":1497099,"title":"","content":"&quot;Then Bluefingers...should we go together or are you coming to the House Up On The Hill alone? She still lives there, doesn't she?&quot; <br /> Halwyn walks towards his car at a brisk pace. Only on the fourth attempt did he manage to insert his key. Before he starts the car, he looks in the mirror and looks at the bed of his pickup. &quot;Fuck it, calm down...&quot; he whispers into the mirror","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-14T10:51:00-08:00","id":1497101,"title":"","content":"Scratch nods, and heads up to Halwyn\u2019s car along with him. \u201cMeet you there,\u201d he says, then gets into his vehicle.<br /> <br /> Heart still racing, Halwyn makes a drive up to the House Up On The Hill, the sole freehold of Lambry County. Governed by the Seasonal Courts, the Winter monarch reigns and the freehold is cloaked in snow and ice. <br /> <br /> A few moments later, Scratch pills in behind Halwyn, the smell of liquor now on his breath. He looks uneasy. \u201cHell,\u201d he complains, \u201cshe\u2019s probably out in the Hedge. Maybe she run outta ink. Maybe we should....go.\u201d<br /> <br /> The door opens, and out comes Ms. Sara Sumpter. Under the Mask she glows like the sun, animate light in the form of a beautiful young woman. Bundled up against the cold, Sumpter looks at Halwyn. \u201cFunny seeing <i>you</i>, Hellhound.\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-14T11:46:26-08:00","id":1497103,"title":"","content":"&quot;I hope she comes back soon&quot; Halwyn is too seldom in the Hedge to find someone there, something he would like to change but just hasn't found the time to do so yet. <br /> <br /> He nods to Ms. Sumpter as she steps through the door. &quot;What's so funny about that?&quot; He asks in amazement and you can still hear the slight tremor in his voice. &quot;We're looking for Bluefingers, there's something threatening living at the lake that we don't know. Maybe she's heard about it.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-14T12:07:38-08:00","id":1497106,"title":"","content":"Sumpter shrugs. \u201cI\u2019ve not seen her. Maybe she\u2019s in that bolthole she calls a room. Lord only knows.<br /> <br /> \u201cAs to what\u2019s funny, some mortal came up here asking about you. Not fae, <i>definitely</i> mortal. The house is still on high alert, just in case, but it\u2019s probably nothing. He wanted to know where <i>you</i> were. I told him get lost, then warned Their Wintiryness about it. Why you haven\u2019t gotten a text by now, I dunno.<br /> <br /> \u201cAnyhow, I\u2019ve got to scoot into town. My husband is having his anniversary with my fetch. I plan from watching from afar, getting drunk, then come back here and cry all night. Then, tomorrow, I\u2019ll move on with my life.\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-14T12:29:21-08:00","id":1497109,"title":"","content":"&quot;Let's check her out, then,&quot; he says to Scratch.<br /> &quot;A Human...strange, that must be the one who checked in on me at the diner,&quot; scratching his head, Halwyn pulls out his cell phone and checks for a message. He lowers his head slightly. &quot;The battery is dead, somehow I always forget to charge it...&quot; With a questioning look he looks back at Ms. Sumpter &quot;Do you know if the Marquessa wanted to see me about that?&quot; <br /> <br /> Who could the human be? really a snooper, but why? Halwyn is still certain he hasn't done anything that would bring him to the attention of a private investigator. <br /> <br /> Sara's evening plans arouse his pity. &quot;If you want, I can stop by later, I can also have a drink or two.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-14T12:45:34-08:00","id":1497110,"title":"","content":"Sumpter shakes her head. \u201cWhat\u2019re you here for? Juniper Lake? Hal, that place stories around it. No Hedge Gates, no hobs, none of us, no Huntsmen....nothing of <i>Them</i>. You\u2019re probably just seeing things, big guy. And now, adieu.\u201d<br /> <br /> With that, she\u2019s gone, down to her car and off on her dismal, self-appointed task.<br /> <br /> Scratch looks deflated. \u201cWe both saw it, didn\u2019t we?\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-14T13:18:32-08:00","id":1497112,"title":"","content":"Hal scratches his head. &quot;I'm very sure...or not...let's go to Bluefingers. Maybe she's there and can give us an answer.&quot; Again and again it seems to him that he sees something in a corner, a shadow, a draft that moves a curtain or an insect that was looking for warmth. He always winces, albeit imperceptibly. The wolf-like being just can't get out of his head. &quot;Do you know what her room is?&quot; Because he has his caravan, he never had to rent a room here, but that also means he rarely, if ever, got an overview of who lives here....and where.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-14T13:31:26-08:00","id":1497114,"title":"","content":"\u201cI\u2019ll lead the way,\u201d Scratch offers, and inside they go.<br /> <br /> It\u2019s absolutely mundane interior is matched by its drab interior, made intentionally that way by the Marquesa. Gone were mementos, family heirlooms and pieces of pop culture; in its place was an empty severity, a simplicity the Others could not comprehend.<br /> <br /> A three story house, it was Spartan in its utility. Come Spring, the freehold would be decorated as jubilantly as was possible, but for now, gloom.<br /> <br /> Up to the third floor the two head, to one of only two doors up that far. The third floor is cramped and clausterphobic by design. They stop at one door. Scratch gives Halwyn a look. \u201cLook...kid...seein\u2019 her can be rough, on new people. Her true self changed way more a\u2019most of us ever do. Just...keep that mind.\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-14T13:44:40-08:00","id":1497115,"title":"","content":"Scratch knocks on the door\u2014-thump! thump! thump!\u2014-then politely waits. It is Bluefingers who answers the door. She must have been pretty once, before her durance, but, after escaping Ironside Bluefingers\u2019d become a shrunken hollow mimicry if a human being. Her fingers ended in quill pen needles, and she wore ten-day-old clothes.<br /> <br /> \u201cWhat,\u201d Bluefingers said bluntly.<br /> <br /> From behind them, Halwyn can see the room is a hoarder\u2019s nightmare, but with a specific focus on the written word.<br /> <br /> From somewhere within the Marquesa\u2019s voice floats out: \u201cClose the door! The heat\u2019s getting in!\u201d<br /> <br /> Bluefingers stares them both in the eye. \u201cWhat. Do. You. Want.\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-14T13:52:47-08:00","id":1497117,"title":"","content":"Somehow he likes this spartan interior. <br /> He follows Scratch and listens carefully as he warns him. &quot;Thanks for the warning, I'll try to keep my composure.&quot;<br /> Don't stare, please don't stare, he tries to command himself. When he sees Bluefingers, he is relieved. In his mind he imagined her to be much worse. &quot;We...&quot; <br /> <br /> To outsiders, it must look funny as the scarred, muscular ogre flinches like a child when the Marquessa raises her voice. &quot;So ..sorry&quot; Following the instruction he closes the door. <br /> <br /> &quot;We need your knowledge. We encountered something at Juniper Lake. A creature that resembled a wolf.&quot; <br /> He fixes his eyes on a single spot on the ground to concentrate. Why does the thought of the creature almost make him tremble again? <br /> &quot;We..., Scratch suspects you might know something about it. What did you call it? Kin of Tur?&quot; he asks, tilting his head at Scratch.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":422,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","user":"Lykas","date":".  I didn't see the text before that. 11-15-2022, 02:57 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-14T14:31:09-08:00","id":1497121,"title":"","content":"[OOC: See the post above yours.]","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-15T08:17:19-08:00","id":1497172,"title":"","content":"Bluefingers looks around suspiciously, then motions for both men to enter. Her room is incredibly small by Ogre standards, a maze of narrow walkways framed by humungous piles of books. Halwyn can <i>barely</i> make out two doors, one leading into the kitchen.<br /> <br /> \u201cAlright,\u201d Bluefingers mutters, \u201cWolf? Juniper Lake? Are you sure you just didn\u2019t see a hob?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-15T08:31:06-08:00","id":1497175,"title":"","content":"Halwyn moves carefully so he doesn't knock anything over.<br /> <br /> &quot;I don't think it was a hob. But I can't say for sure.&quot; <br /> He looks at Scratch &quot;It wanted Scratch to sacrifice himself to protect Damien, but he can explain that better. When I went to defend him it took off because people showed up.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-15T08:39:37-08:00","id":1497176,"title":"","content":"She thinks a moment, then bursts into activity, scrounging like a madwoman through books upon books upon books, til she at last holds one high, and shouts, \u201c<i>I\u2019ve got it!</i>\u201d, before muttering to herself and tossing the tome away. After a few minutes of searching, she pulls out a very thin book. \u201cHere we go,\u201d she whispers.<br /> <br /> Bluefingers holds up the book. Written in the year 1910, it compiled various Native American myths. Bluefingers flips through the pages, then stops at a specific part. \u201c\u2018Kin of Tar\u2019? Hmmm. According to this account from the west coast, several tribes believes in water-demons that took wolf form. They worshipped an even <i>greater</i> demon, these hellwolves, and would rise up at night and whisper horrible truths into the ears of the sleeping.\u201d She slams the book shut.<br /> <br /> \u201cThat\u2019s it,\u201d Bluefingers says apologetically. \u201cWe\u2019re in Montana, boys, pretty far from the ocean. You should be lucky I could even dig up <i>this</i> much.<br /> <br /> \u201cHowever...it\u2019s said these seawolves kept great stone markers buried under the tide. Dunno if that helps.\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-15T09:04:02-08:00","id":1497178,"title":"","content":"He carefully absorbs every word Bluefingers says about these demons. &quot;Is it possible that one of those demons got into the lake? I know it's far away, maybe some of the natives brought one with them when they fled from the shore from the white ones.&quot; <br /> With his eyes closed, he shakes his head. &quot;That sounds silly...sorry. May I borrow the book?&quot; He scratches the back of his head with his hand. He tries to look as friendly as possible.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-15T09:10:59-08:00","id":1497180,"title":"","content":"Bluefingers ponders a moment, then extends her hand, book held out. \u201cReturn it to me when you\u2019re finished with it.\u201d She looks at the closed door. \u201cGotta go. Sorry I couldn\u2019t be more helpful, boys.\u201d<br /> <br /> The two exit the room. Scratch frowns. \u201cA <i>demon</i>? The fuck do wolves and the sea have in common? <i>Nothin\u2019</i>! I need to get Damien. Me and him\u2019re buggin\u2019 out.\u201d He looks Halwyn straight in the eye. \u201cI believe the demon, though: Huntsmen <i>are</i> comin\u2019. Good luck. You\u2019ll need evidence to persuade freeholders you ain\u2019t losing your marbles.\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-15T09:44:00-08:00","id":1497182,"title":"","content":"&quot;I promise I'll bring it back&quot; He bites his tongue, promises, oaths and the like, they still come out of his mouth too quickly. &quot;I think that's a big help, thanks a lot&quot; <br /> <br /> &quot;Wolves and the ocean...&quot; He thinks a little &quot;...I don't know.<br /> But I don't know much about myths outside of Ireland&quot; <br /> <br /> A bit shocked by the old minotaur's plan, he just stares at him. &quot;You want to escape and abandon everyone here?&quot; Anger rises in him, which he swallows back down. &quot;You know who I'm most likely to listen to? Heck, if Huntsmen are really coming, then we have to prepare for it. And I think we need your help.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-15T10:08:02-08:00","id":1497184,"title":"","content":"Scratch\u2019s face reddens with shame, and he averts his gaze. \u201cI....I can\u2019t go back, Hellhound. I <i>can\u2019t</i>. I\u2019m old, tired and wearin\u2019 out. I\u2019m easy pickin\u2019s. And Damien can\u2019t fight worth a good goddamn.\u201d But he face scrunches up in anger. \u201cBut don\u2019t you <i>ever</i> call me a coward. I\u2019ll stay. Damn you, I\u2019ll stay.\u201d<br /> <br /> As the two men walk about, Scratch asks, \u201cWe\u2019re awful far from the Pacific, son. These were demons of the <i>sea</i>. The fuck they doin\u2019 <i>this</i> far inland? Hell, maybe it <i>was</i> a hob...\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-15T10:24:27-08:00","id":1497187,"title":"","content":"&quot;It's all the more important that we prepare, you have to let us all take part in your experiences. That's the only way we'll get through it. And remember, we're stronger in a pack.&quot; A mentality that he probably won't discard anytime soon. <br /> <br /> &quot;You know Scratch, I hope it's just a hob. But somehow I doubt it.&quot; <br /> <br /> He turns around in a flash. &quot;Oh crap, I wanted to ask the Marquessa about the stranger...&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-15T10:37:47-08:00","id":1497188,"title":"","content":"Scratch laughs. \u201cShe might be <i>occupied</i>, at the moment.\u201d He pauses a moment. \u201cActually, there might be somebody we <i>can</i> talk to: our resident IT guy. Just remembered we have cameras! He may\u2019a caught something!\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-15T10:41:36-08:00","id":1497189,"title":"","content":"Then men descend into the basement, occupied solely by Eloi. Looking for all intents and purposes as a Whitley Streiber \u2018grey\u2019 alien, Eloi was a tech nerd even before his lab scientist Gentry got their hands on him.<br /> <br /> The basement is loaded with computer equipment, monitors and an ocean of keyboards. A workshop dominates the basement\u2019s left half. This is where Eloi is. A small radio sits behind him blaring heavy metal music while he works on something. He doesn\u2019t notice the pair come in.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-15T10:50:27-08:00","id":1497191,"title":"","content":"He looks around with a keen eye. &quot;Yes, you may be right.&quot; <br /> <br /> Arriving in Eloi's basement, he first covers his ears. The music and all the tech stuff here is too much for Halwyn. &quot;Hey buddy, we have a question, can we interrupt you for a minute?&quot; he calls to the gray guy. <br /> &quot;Hey Eloi....&quot; his voice tries to drown out the music.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-15T11:19:40-08:00","id":1497193,"title":"","content":"Eloi turns off the music, then turns to face Scratch and Halwyn. His triangular face an expressionless, dour countenance, Eloi whispers, \u201cYes? Does the Marquesa need something?\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-15T11:52:47-08:00","id":1497195,"title":"","content":"&quot;Not directly. <br /> Today a man asked for me, both in the diner and here. But I don't know who it could be and I haven't seen him yet. Scratch says you have cameras everywhere that might have picked him up.&quot; he steps closer to the young man.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-15T12:03:42-08:00","id":1497196,"title":"","content":"Eloi nods. \u201cI do.\u201d He walks back to the half of the basement devoted to his computers and putters around on them for a few minutes, before pulling up CCTV footage.<br /> <br /> The footage depicts a tall, man, maybe 6\u20191\u201d or 6\u20192\u201d, but rail thin. He is white and thickly bearded, though the beard is neatly trimmed and well maintained. He wears clothing vaguely reminiscent of an authority figure\u2014\u2014a uniform of some sort\u2014\u2014without actually <i>saying</i> what agency he represents. The camera has him walking back to his car, and Eloi gives a low chuckle. \u201cWe have his license plate number. Dumb bastard.\u201d<br /> <br /> His fingers fly over the keyboard, but he simply cannot find the license plate in any registry. Eloi looks at them. \u201cPrint you up a picture?\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-15T12:18:13-08:00","id":1497198,"title":"","content":"&quot;Yeah sure. <br /> Who is that guy...can you check with your computer if there's any manhunts running against me? I didn't know why, except if ...He... might have done something&quot; The memory of his fetch keeps him with his teeth gnashing. Slowly, in his mind he counts down from ten to calm himself down. <br /> Apart from Minos, no one should actually know where he is... maybe he should give him a call. He's rummaging around for his mobile phone, but puts it back in his pocket because the empty battery. <br /> <br /> &quot;oh and could you look something up on the internet? 'Kin of Tar' maybe you'll find something about it. If you have the time for this.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-15T12:21:16-08:00","id":1497199,"title":"","content":"Eloi nods. \u201cI\u2019ll need your real name.\u201d He pauses. \u201cNo other way around it. If that\u2019s a dealbreaker, I\u2019ll understand..<br /> <br /> \u201cNow, kin of tar? Sounds like mud wrestlers or something. It may take some digging, but I\u2019ll see what I can see.\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-15T12:31:36-08:00","id":1497200,"title":"","content":"&quot;It's Halwyn Montgomery, at least that's the only name I remember other than Hellhound,&quot; he says without hesitation. <br /> &quot;The Kin of Tar belong to Native American mythology. But anything you find might be interesting.&quot; <br /> <br /> He considers for a moment &quot;Do I owe you anything?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-15T12:38:08-08:00","id":1497203,"title":"","content":"Eloi shrugs. \u201cYou owe me a taco grande and a large Coca-Cola. Other than that, we\u2019re golden.\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-15T12:45:20-08:00","id":1497204,"title":"","content":"&quot;I'm better at frying burgers, but I guess that's no problem. Just drop by the diner and you'll get it.&quot; he grins broadly.<br /> <br /> &quot;I'm sure you have my phone number. Just let me know if you find something and I'll come right away.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-15T12:48:32-08:00","id":1497205,"title":"","content":"[OOC: Ok, What now?]","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-15T12:57:29-08:00","id":1497207,"title":"","content":"&quot;See you later then&quot; Halwyn nods to Eloi and goes back upstairs with Scratch. <br /> <br /> &quot;I don't know if we can do more today,&quot; he says on the way. &quot;Let's talk at the diner tomorrow. I'm very interested in what you have to say about Hobs and such. I still have a lot to learn I think.&quot; questioningly he looks Scratch in the eye &quot;Are you okay with that?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-15T13:04:15-08:00","id":1497208,"title":"","content":"Scratch nods glumly. \u201cDrop me off in Traveler\u2019s Peak,\u201d mentioning a campsite near Arcadia State Park. It was an open secret going into that Forest was trouble, but it was <i>also</i> an open secret Scratch knew of a trod nearby. He had a Hollow on the other, a well-stocked one, too.<br /> <br /> As Halwyn drove, Scratch shifted uneasily in his seat several times. But he said nothing, just staring ahead.<br /> <br /> Arcadia State Park was a huge forested reserve popular with campers. But for the freehold, it held untold dangers. Despite not having a lake inside it\u2014\u2014mostly streams, broke and ponds\u2014-it was whispered fish-hob that could walk upright protected the place.<br /> <br /> As they pull into the parking lot, Scratch sighed. \u201cWhat if I made a mistake?\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-15T13:17:57-08:00","id":1497209,"title":"","content":"&quot;If you've made a mistake, we'll fix it. Everyone makes mistakes. Learning from them and not repeating them is the art.&quot; it sounds a bit precocious, but Halwyn speaks with conviction. <br /> <br /> &quot;Are you sure it's safe here?&quot; His gaze wanders around the area. &quot;I mean because of the Hobs&quot; Together with Scratch he leaves the car and walks a little further across the parking lot. &quot;We can do it, no matter what awaits us,&quot; he says quietly, perhaps to convince himself. <br /> <br /> &quot;I won't go any further here. I'll see you tomorrow.&quot; He looks deep into Scratch's eyes again to show him his seriousness. &quot;Until then&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-15T13:25:57-08:00","id":1497210,"title":"","content":"Scratch just mutely nods, then disembarks. He pauses before shutting the door. \u201cAin\u2019t never seen no fish-hobs in this here forest; then, didn\u2019t expect a wolf to come outta the lake.\u201d<br /> <br /> With that, he slams the door and disappears into the woodlands.<br /> <br /> [OOC: Alrighty then. Where now?]","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-15T13:39:06-08:00","id":1497211,"title":"","content":"Halwyn goes back to his car. The whole day has been a bit upsetting for him. Although this feeling has only existed since the creature. <br /> <br /> His car makes stuttering noises at first, but then it starts. Again he checks his loading area through the mirror to see if there might be something on it. Then he drives off, first slowly because he doesn't know this area that well, then faster to finally be back in his caravan. <br /> <br /> Cold creeps up his spine, not from the weather but from the thought of the demon. For a moment he is not paying attention. Something seems to be on its way. At least he thinks so, and he turns his steering wheel hard to one side. The car crashes through the barrier and hits a tree. <br /> <br /> &quot;Damn shit!&quot; he yells and after some minutes He carefully gets out of his car. was there really something or did he imagine it?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-15T14:44:22-08:00","id":1497221,"title":"","content":"As he stares, trying to sort his thoughts, a man from across the field to Halwyn\u2019s left\u2014-over 100-some yards away\u2014-begins running towards the crash and full speed. He skidded to a stop when he saw Halwyn standing.<br /> <br /> \u201cHoly <i>shit</i>!\u201d The stranger said. He reaches into his pocket and pulls out a cellphone. \u201cI\u2019m going to call emergency services!\u201d<br /> <br /> In the distance, though he\u2019s only hearing things in his imagination, hunting hounds bay. It takes a minute for Halwyn to register he\u2019s in shock. That the sound isn\u2019t real.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-15T15:01:43-08:00","id":1497223,"title":"","content":"&quot;Did...I almost hit you?&quot; Although he addresses the man, he looks the other way, following the fading sound of the hounds. When he is sure that they are not real, he looks at the stranger. <br /> &quot;Emergency service?...oh crap...my car&quot; now he does fully realize that he is standing next to his car. Slight pain is noticeable on his forehead and when he touches it, his fingers turn a little red. In addition, his knee has also gotten something. But he will survive. <br /> &quot;Can you help me onto the loading area for a moment? I have to sit down for a moment&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-15T15:08:08-08:00","id":1497224,"title":"","content":"The man says, \u201cCome here,\u201d and guides Halwyn away from the car, to sit on the curb.<br /> <br /> The snowfall intensifies. The wind howls. The world seems stark and empty.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-15T15:18:53-08:00","id":1497228,"title":"","content":"Halwyn looks closely at his helper. &quot;Thank you very much&quot; He lowered himself onto the curb. &quot;Are you all right?&quot; he asks and looks at the car of the other. He fumbles for a handkerchief and wipes the blood from his forehead before looking around again. That feeling of emptiness... he doesn't like it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-15T15:31:41-08:00","id":1497230,"title":"","content":"\u201cI wasn\u2019t driving,\u201d the stranger said. \u201cI was....just <i>out</i>, taking in some Mother Nature. I was <i>way</i> across the way. I\u2019m not injured at <i>all</i>. Are <i>you</i> ok?\u201d<br /> <br /> From the field the stranger had run out of, a lone German Shepherd stood watch, keenly alert, before running off.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12219,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","user":"Demigod Beast","date":". 11-15-2022, 07:37 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-15T23:56:42-08:00","id":1497269,"title":"","content":"&quot;I'm glad about that&quot; but he still looks at the street, not that he had caught anyone else. <br /> <br /> &quot;I'm fine I think...a bit of a headache and I think I hit my knee. Does my car look very bad?&quot;<br /> At least one part of his car was broken, he knew without looking. Since he got the car from Minos, there hasn't been three consecutive days that one of his taillights hasn't blown. His guess is that was the Wyrd's price for the gift. The car was free, but it was more of a hassle than expected. <br /> &quot;Is this your dog? Not that he runs away like that unsupervised&quot; he looks at the dog and smiles without teeth.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-16T10:43:38-08:00","id":1497289,"title":"","content":"The stranger looks confused, but instead of answering, he calls for an ambulance.<br /> <br /> Though he was certain his cell was dead, it begins to ring from his pocket, quite abruptly.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-16T10:54:57-08:00","id":1497291,"title":"","content":"&quot;I don't think I need an ambula...&quot; he says, but is then distracted by his cell phone. <br /> A little confused, he looks at it and answers it. &quot;Montgomery on line, who's speaking?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-16T11:00:57-08:00","id":1497292,"title":"","content":"The voice on the other line is speaking very, <i>very</i> low, a voice he doesn\u2019t recognize. \u201c<i>Get. Out. Of. There. They\u2019re coming.</i>\u201d Then hangs up.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-16T11:14:01-08:00","id":1497296,"title":"","content":"&quot;Get out of there...they're coming...&quot; he repeats very quietly and turns pale. &quot;Yeah, thanks Buddy, for the warning.&quot; he then says louder before pretending to hang up. <br /> Suddenly he straightens up and goes to his car. &quot;We have to get out of here...&quot; he says to the stranger. <br /> &quot;It's about to get uncomfortable here... a storm is coming up&quot; he hopes that this lie will convince him, he can hardly tell what's really going on... from the fact that he doesn't know it himself.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-16T11:28:05-08:00","id":1497299,"title":"","content":"[OOC: Alrighty then, CoyoteCode time! Roll Manipulation + Socialize!]","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-16T11:38:47-08:00","id":1497301,"title":"","content":"[OOC: May I substitute subterfuge for socialize? And can I use a willpower point?]","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-16T11:39:54-08:00","id":1497302,"title":"","content":"[OOC: Yes, to both. Post a link to your roll here.]","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-16T11:47:07-08:00","id":1497303,"title":"","content":"[OOC 6dice ]<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://roll.coyotecode.net