ies. \u201cYou weren\u2019t kidding,\u201d the man says. \u201cMy name\u2019s Dan. You?\u201d<br /> <br /> By this point they\u2019ve crossed the field on the opposite side of the road, and the man\u2019s modest home comes into view. One storey, cozy, well-maintained. Inside the back door they go, into a clean, orderly living room, where Dan helps Halwyn sit down on the couch.<br /> <br /> Looking around, it appears Dan\u2019s home looks...<i>sterile</i>. It lacked personality. No knickknacks, no heirlooms, not even a single painting on the Wall.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-16T13:36:03-08:00","id":1497310,"title":"","content":"Before they leave, Halwyn takes his keys and everything important out of the car. <br /> <br /> &quot;I'm Halwyn, nice to meet you. I think without you I'd be in serious trouble right now.&quot; <br /> <br /> Inside the house, he looks around the living room from the sofa. &quot;Have you only lived here recently? It all still looks so...new. But cozy too.&quot; <br /> With his hands he checks his knee. <br /> <br /> &quot;That dog was yours out there, wasn't it?&quot; He looks around again, this time to see if he sees any traces of a dog owner.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-16T14:05:46-08:00","