was he warned about the situation here? <br /> <br /> <i>four</i> <br /> <br /> Whatever it is, he wants an answer from Dan. <br /> <br /> He didn't have to count any further to get his anger under control. <br /> He walks to the front door, picks up his notebook, and on one of the pages writes his approximate location, not far from Travelers Peak, and a short message &gt;From Halwyn. possibly danger. storm unnatural. received a strange message on my cell phone. From Eloi? take care of you all. maybe huntsmen' Then he opens the door, grabs some snow and shapes it into a rough-looking rabbit. He stabs his hand with one of his claws, just enough to spurt a few drops of blood. He lets these drip onto the figure like little eyes. He whispers soft words, almost growling them, and the rabbit begins to tremble and move. &quot;Bring this message to the House Up On The Hill for someone to find.&quot; he whispers to the snow rabbit and watches it hop away. Then he shuts the door again, licks off the remaining drops of blood and sits on the couch.<br /> On the couch he waits for Dan to come back.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":422,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","user":"Lykas","date":". 11-19-2022, 12:51 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-19T10:23:13-08:00","id":1497536,"title":"","content":"As he shuts the door, the rabbit gives a little salute before zooming off.<br /> <br /> Dan comes in, and says, \u201cIt\u2019ll be stormy, awhile. Why don\u2019t I show you the guest bedroom? As soon as the weather clears, I\u2019ll call AAA and see what can be done about your car, ok?\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-19T10:39:33-08:00","id":1497538,"title":"","content":"&quot;Hey buddy, I have a question for you.&quot; He's trying not to look threatening when he says it. <br /> &quot;What's the matter with you all of a sudden. You were in a good mood a moment ago, but since I took a shower and you talked to someone, you've changed. I won't hurt you, but I have to know if I get into trouble here.&quot; <br /> That he heard parts of the phone call, he is still concealing.<br /> <br /> &quot;Let's be honest with each other. Alright?&quot; He looks at him seriously but still calmly.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-19T10:44:50-08:00","id":1497539,"title":"","content":"Dan looks unconcerned.<br /> <br /> [OOC: Wits + Subterfuge, please.]<br /> <br /> He laughs. \u201cMy boss unexpectedly showed up. In <i>this</i> weather! Anyhow, I didn\u2019t want him thinking...the wrong thing....so I hurried him out the door.\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-19T10:52:45-08:00","id":1497540,"title":"","content":"[<a href=\"http://roll.coyotecode.net/lookup.php?rollid=271334\" target=\"_blank\">http://roll.coyotecode.net/lookup.php?rollid=271334</a><br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://roll.coyotecode.net/lookup.php?rollid=271335\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"http://roll.coyotecode.net/images/logo.gif\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://roll.coyotecode.net/lookup.php?rollid=271335\" target=\"_blank\"> CoyoteCode Dice Roller </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://roll.coyotecode.net/lookup.php?rollid=271335\" target=\"_blank\"> http://roll.coyotecode.net/lookup.php?rollid=271335 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> 4 Successes]","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-19T11:06:57-08:00","id":1497543,"title":"","content":"<i>thinking the wrong thing....</i>For a tiny moment Halwyn looks confused.<br /> <br /> &quot;You call that honesty?&quot; he asks with a little disappointment in his voice.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-19T11:08:56-08:00","id":1497544,"title":"","content":"Dan\u2019s face goes pale, he grows very still. \u201cYou need to leave,\u201d he says quietly. \u201cYou need to go, <i>right now</i>.\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-19T11:17:53-08:00","id":1497546,"title":"","content":"He looks at Dan without batting an eyelid. <br /> &quot;Are you having problems? If I leave here, what will happen to you? Honest answer, immediately&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-19T11:26:52-08:00","id":1497548,"title":"","content":"Dan sighs, then sits heavily down on the chair. He looks at the ground. \u201cI\u2019m in the closet. My \u2018friend\u2019 Cale is trying to blackmail me. I...look, I\u2019m sorry, but Cale thinks....well, it doesn\u2019t matter <i>what</i> he thinks. What he <i>believes</i> is the issue.<br /> <br /> \u201cCale and I...we...had a thing going on, then he tried recruiting me into a weird cult. I said no, he...um, left me...and I deliberately got transferred to the Juniper Lake study because Cale swore he\u2019d never come back to his home town. Guess what? Cale lies.\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-19T11:47:27-08:00","id":1497552,"title":"","content":"&quot;Where are you in?&quot; He looks around naively. <br /> <br /> &quot;That Cale guy, what does he believe in? What kind of cult is that? Are they dangerous? And what do they want from me?&quot; <br /> Anger boils up in him again, not at Dan, but at this Cale. And Halwyn doesn't even know why. <br /> &quot;Can...can I help you somehow? What exactly is he blackmailing you with?&quot; he asks thoughtfully.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":422,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","user":"Lykas","date":". 11-19-2022, 07:00 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-19T16:34:10-08:00","id":1497582,"title":"","content":"Dan looks down at the flood. \u201cI\u2019m gay, ok? Except the Church I go to\u2014-my whole <i>world</i>, really, all my family, friends, neighbors\u2014-condemns it. Cale is threatening to out me.\u201d<br /> <br /> Outside, the wind picks up, the snow increases dramatically. Halwyn can hear the sound of a wolf howling in the distance, though Dan doesn\u2019t seem to notice.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-19T23:54:24-08:00","id":1497612,"title":"","content":"&quot;Oh...&quot; Halwyn falls silent. <br /> <br /> &quot;That...that sucks&quot; he just doesn't know what to say, then he remembers his childhood, his rebellious phase. One of the later memories that became clearer to him over time.<br /> <br /> &quot;I can only give one piece of advice from my childhood. When no one accepts you as you are, cut those threads that are hurting you and start something new. It's going to be tough, but that's the only way you'll find happiness. For me it was the right way back then.&quot; <br /> <br /> He remembers the time with his girlfriend, that was the best time...but why can't he remember her name? <br /> <br /> He goes to the window &quot;Did you hear that? It sounded like a wolf...&quot; he looks at Dan's reaction.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":422,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","user":"Lykas","date":". 11-20-2022, 12:02 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-20T10:39:24-08:00","id":1497643,"title":"","content":"\u201cI didn\u2019t hear anything,\u201d Dan replies.<br /> <br /> Meanwhile, the wind whips up again, and then, at the door, <b>BANG!</b>, <b>BANG!</b>, <b>BANG!</b>, and Dan about jumps out of his skin. Timidly, he gets to his feet, inchworming his way to the door.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-20T11:26:01-08:00","id":1497650,"title":"","content":"Halwyn instinctively reaches for his lighter. &quot;Dan what are you doing, stay away from the door&quot; he says to him. He's trying to go through the options in his head. <br /> <i>Run away?</i> Difficult and then he would leave Dan here alone with whatever. <br /> <i>Fight?</i> Possible, but he doesn't know what to expect. <br /> <i>Talking?</i> Even harder since he still doesn't know what's there. <br /> <i>A trade...?</i> Dangerous but possible. Minos said that Huntsmen can't see you if you're making deals with mortals. But now it could be too late. <br /> <br /> Than an idea hits him, he doesn't have to leave Dan here and he might even be able to escape with him. &quot;If we're in danger, I'll get us out of here. But you have to trust me.&quot; he says. <br /> In his mind, he's trying to prepare himself for what's to come.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":422,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","user":"Lykas","date":". 11-21-2022, 08:53 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-21T08:46:52-08:00","id":1497715,"title":"","content":"A voice booms through the door. \u201c<i>Hound! Your mistress calls! Hound! Your mistress calls! Return home! In chains or at my lead, which suits your fancy!</i>\u201d<br /> <br /> And then the banging abruptly stops.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-21T09:06:25-08:00","id":1497718,"title":"","content":"A cold pang runs through Halwyn's spine. &quot;Oh shit...&quot; he says half out loud. <br /> He stares at the door &quot;We have to get out of here....I have to get out of here....&quot; He whispers almost anxiously. &quot;How did they get here....&quot; He looks at Dan.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-21T09:31:41-08:00","id":1497721,"title":"","content":"Dan gives Halwyn a terrified look, then, trembling, approaches the door. He <i>almost</i> makes it there when a knock sounds out, and Halwyn can hear Scratch say, \u201cI dunno, he might not even be here. Just what the little critter told me. Um, hello? I\u2019m here for Halwyn?\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-21T09:47:19-08:00","id":1497724,"title":"","content":"Halwyn almost pisses his pants. He breathes a sigh of relief when he hears Scratch's voice. Then another moment of panic. Can huntsmen imitate voices? Perhaps, but a hunter of his mistress would not resort to such a trick. <br /> <br /> He nods to Dan, but still prepares to flee. He looks at the door with hope that it really is Scratch","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-22T09:56:11-08:00","id":1497806,"title":"","content":"Dan hesitantly opens the door, to reveal Old Man Scratch on the other side, with Scratch on a cellphone. He says, \u201cNope, don\u2019t worry, found him,\u201d then gives Halwyn a look. \u201cYou had us right scared, boy.\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-22T10:21:08-08:00","id":1497811,"title":"","content":"&quot;Good man, believe me, I was more frightened than you.&quot; he says relieved. <br /> <br /> &quot;Dan this is...&quot; he pauses briefly &quot;...Devlin, an acquaintance of mine.&quot; He didn't want to just announce Scratch's name.<br /> &quot;This is Dan, he helped me when my car went off track.&quot; He points to Dan. <br /> &quot;You got my message? I thought my phone was dead.&quot; he clears his throat. &quot;Are you here with the car?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-22T11:37:16-08:00","id":1497820,"title":"","content":"Scratch nods. \u201cMy truck, actually. C\u2019mon. We gotta get you looked at.\u201d<br /> <br /> Dan smiles sheepishly, but says nothing.<br /> <br /> As the two men get into the truck, Scratch says, without pausing, \u201cWhat\u2019s goin\u2019 on, boy? You sound all shook up.\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-22T12:03:46-08:00","id":1497822,"title":"","content":"&quot;Looks like you won't have to put up with me here after today. Your luck, I snore extremely loudly. Come by the dinner one day, I invite you. I would like to talk to you,&quot; he says with a smile Dan. <br /> <br /> Once in the car, he leans back in the seat. &quot;Scratch, that huntsman, he's here for me. He wants to get me back. He came all the way from Ireland...&quot; Halwyn's voice is filled with unfamiliar fear. &quot;What shall I do?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-22T12:08:41-08:00","id":1497824,"title":"","content":"Scratch pulls the truck out onto the main drag and puts petal to metal.<br /> <br /> He thinks. \u201cI dunno. But it\u2019s Winter, so, the Huntsmen got to abide by Winter\u2019s Bargain. Every foe they kill, they gotta mourn over before movin\u2019 on. \u2018Course, the Others don\u2019t know grief if it bit \u2018em in the ass, but they gotta go through the motions. <br /> <br /> \u201cSo, I take it you met the Huntsman\u2019s herald? Huntsmen\u2019re showy bastard\u2019s, got a lot of pride in themselves. They warn you, \u2018fore they come lookin\u2019 for you.\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-22T12:31:40-08:00","id":1497829,"title":"","content":"&quot;Huntsman or Herald, whatever, it scared the shit out of me. Also, this Dan was talking about a cult that exists here...maybe they're related to the gentry...&quot; He looks around the area drive around &quot;Where are you taking us?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-22T13:14:20-08:00","id":1497834,"title":"","content":"\u201cBack to the freehold. The Marquesa needs to hear this. Shit just got real, Hellhound, shit just got real.<br /> <br /> \u201cWhy\u2019d you crash? See something?\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-22T13:29:51-08:00","id":1497838,"title":"","content":"&quot;At least I thought so. Maybe I saw something. When Dan helped me, a shepherd dog watched me. It could have been a coincidence.&quot; <br /> <br /> He thinks for a moment. &quot;Dan had been on the phone with someone who seemed interested in me but he wouldn't hand me over.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-22T13:41:51-08:00","id":1497841,"title":"","content":"\u201cDan? Who? That guy back there?\u201d Scratch thinks, a moment. \u201cMaybe get Eloi to do some diggin\u2019 on the net...or the BriarNet. Not just a rumor, that. Genuine thing. Can\u2019t make heads or tails of any of it.\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-22T13:56:26-08:00","id":1497845,"title":"","content":"&quot;What is the BriarNet?...I don't really get along with the normal internet yet...&quot; he scratches his head. <br /> &quot;But that's right, Eloi could find information. <br /> When we're in the freehold, I need something between my teeth first,&quot; a stomach growl supports the statement.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-26T09:29:50-08:00","id":1498087,"title":"","content":"The two men pull into the yard of the House Up On The Hill, only to be greeted by the Marquesa, the princess of Winter. Scratch wasn\u2019t kidding, when he mentioned how profoundly she\u2019d been changed by her durance: pale, milky white, beautiful in a waifish kind of way, her head had cracked open and a stalk of grey fungus protruded out. <br /> <br /> She was waiting outside, and, as soon as both men exit the vehicles, demands, \u201cWhat\u2019s all this about, then?\u201d Her voice is high-pitched and somewhat shrill.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-26T10:16:19-08:00","id":1498088,"title":"","content":"&quot;Oh damn, she looks upset...is she upset?&quot; a gulp escapes Halwyn's throat as he sees the Marquessa standing there.<br /> <br /> &quot;Your wintry highness, where do I begin. There is a strange creature making pacts in Juniper Lake. A unknown man is looking for me, but I don't know why. There seems to be a cult that... was also after me, but that may be coincidence. And one of my keeper's huntsmen is after me...&quot;<br /> He didn't dare interrupt the respectful bow, mainly because he didn't want to see the Marquessa getting angry. <br /> &quot;I think that's all I can report.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-26T10:42:38-08:00","id":1498091,"title":"","content":"\u201cCome inside.\u201d<br /> <br /> They enter the freehold, and head up to the Marquesa\u2019s room, which is a cobwebby affair, all theatre props, classical costumes and things probably stolen directly off movie sets. Her room is cramped, but not to the level of a hoarder, and she leads both men to the bathroom, which is unadorned save for a toilet and a full-length mirror.<br /> <br /> \u201cWe\u2019re going into the Hedge,\u201d she says.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-26T10:49:05-08:00","id":1498093,"title":"","content":"Halwyn follows her and looks around the room out of the corner of his eye. This was his first time in her room, as far as he knows, though he tries not to look too curious. <br /> <br /> <i>Into the hedge</i> he avoided going there. He didn't feel comfortable there and can count on two hands how many times he's been in there. <br /> Nevertheless, he nods resignedly.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":422,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","user":"Lykas","date":". 11-27-2022, 03:23 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-27T09:45:28-08:00","id":1498132,"title":"","content":"The Marquesa sings, \u201c<i>Never in Summer, never in Spring/Never in Autumn til it\u2019s last wing/Come Winter come snow/Come despair and sorrow/Open the door now for me</i>.\u201d Then she touches the mirror, and it ripples like water. All three pass through.<br /> <br /> The Hedge: a psychoreactive place, only somewhat \u2018real\u2019 in a traditional sense, it delineated the wilderness separating Earth from Arcadia. Here, Earthly stability and Arcadian madness met and mingled, a thorny maze designed to protect both sides of the equation.<br /> <br /> It was Winter\u2019s time, and so the Hedge was covered in ice and snow, like an Arctic forest. It seemed as if warmth was impossible, here. The Hedge was framed as a series of rows of thickly entangled trees, while small hobs the size of very tiny birds watched from all around.<br /> <br /> The Marquesa took a moment. \u201cWe\u2019re going to Bucketown. It\u2019s a hob township, <i>not</i> a Market. Still, be careful. Hobs aren\u2019t as lethal as the Others, but never forget they\u2019re not human, either.\u201d<br /> <br /> And the three set off.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12219,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","user":"Demigod Beast","date":". 11-27-2022, 12:47 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-27T10:37:29-08:00","id":1498134,"title":"","content":"Halwyn is trying to memorize the song, who knows when it will be needed again. <br /> As soon as he got to the other side, a shiver came over him. It's not as cold as it was during his time in Arcadia, but an oppressive feeling creeps into his limbs. <br /> <br /> &quot;Is there anything to watch out for in Bucketown?&quot; Although he hasn't encountered many hobs, he knows that many have unusual habits. He has to pay attention to every word he says, preferably staying as still as possible. <br /> &quot;Why are we going there anyway?&quot; He's biting his tongue, so much to pay attention to his words... <br /> <br /> He pulls his jacket on and puts his arms around himself. The cold is bothering him.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-27T10:50:59-08:00","id":1498135,"title":"","content":"The Marquesa says, \u201cAlways kick the Bucket when you enter Bucketown.<br /> <br /> \u201cWhy? Why go to Bucketown? Bucketown is obsessed with death\u2014-specifically, the trappings of funerals. They have a seer there, calls herself Witchypoo. We need to consult her. She...hears things whispered by Hedge ghosts\u2014-<i>and</i> more \u2018normal\u2019 ghosts, if you believe in that sort of thing.\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-27T11:31:06-08:00","id":1498141,"title":"","content":"A little confused, he tries to remember this instruction. Doesn't seem difficult, besides, the Marquessa will do the same. <br /> <br /> Witchypoo...strange name but that's what some entities have. So she hears things from hedge ghosts and normal ghosts, He pricks up his ears. <br /> <br /> &quot;Yes, I believe in ghosts, even if I can't see them...I believe one is alive...exists in the playground near my work.&quot; he replies.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-27T11:58:55-08:00","id":1498147,"title":"","content":"\u201cThen let\u2019s go,\u201d she says, and the three of them begin walking.<br /> <br /> The Hedge is strangely claustrophobic, with a canopy so thick it only barely allows in cracks of sunlight here and there. The Marquesa knows where she\u2019s going, and leads the two men down a series of forested \u2018corridors\u2019. It appears she\u2019s leading them in a circle, before the Hedge unexpected gives way to a thick, long, high wall made of oak boards, with sharpened sticks with pigs\u2019 heads impaled by them here and there.<br /> <br /> There is a single visible gate in, and manning that gate is a single hob, a meter tall and weighing as much as a small child, wearing Mad Max-style armor and the helmet of an American-style football player. It\u2019s skin is bright, neon green, and it looks asleep. The three walk right up to it. It is still asleep. The Marquesa audibly clears her throat, and the hob jumps awake.<br /> <br /> It looks about warily, then is obviously morbidly embarrassed at having being caught napping. It looks ashamedly at the ground. \u201cMa\u2019kessa,\u201d it mumbles. \u201cYa won\u2019t...\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cI won\u2019t tell anyone <i>what</i> Hodge? That you were asleep on the job again?\u201d The Marquesa snaps. \u201cLet us in, you imbecile, and I\u2019ll keep quiet.\u201d<br /> <br /> The hob mumbles an apology then knocks on the gate, which begins to crank open via some winching mechanism.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-27T12:55:33-08:00","id":1498158,"title":"","content":"Step by step he follows the Marquessa and never takes his eyes off her. He doesn't want to get lost in the thorns. <br /> <br /> Arriving at the wall, he allows himself to look around for the first time. He wonders if the stockade is built to keep danger out or to keep something else trapped inside. <br /> <br /> He can't help but grin when he overhears the conversation between the Marquessa and the Hob. Then he looks around to see if he can spot the ominous bucket somewhere. <br /> As the gate opens, he tenses his muscles a bit, just to be safe.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-27T13:35:16-08:00","id":1498164,"title":"","content":"Before they even step through the gate, an even tinier hob with a bucket on its head comes running out, making squeaking noises. The Marquesa soundly kicks it in the head, then enters.<br /> <br /> The bucket-wearing hob picks itself up and approaches Halwyn, making more squeaking noises.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-27T13:41:39-08:00","id":1498165,"title":"","content":"Halwyn looks at little Hob and almost laughs. His foot swings a little and he kicks the little guy. Careful that he hasn't kicked too hard, he looks after him. <br /> He then follows the Marquessa. <br /> <br /> &quot;Are there others that you have to kick or is he the only one?&quot; he asks his guide. <br /> <br /> His gaze then wanders over what lies in front of him.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-28T18:07:13-08:00","id":1498253,"title":"","content":"As the two men enter Bucketown, a grim and morbid sight awaits them. Bucketown is a town built around a single business, and that business is funerals, taxidermy and embalming. A bizarre smell of formaldehyde is pungent to the point of nausea.<br /> <br /> Every single building in Bucketown is death-centric, from comically tiny funeral homes to graveyards where picnics are held every day, to a crimson cathedral made of bird bones. The hobs that move about are universally very small, and resemble upright walking cats. Each cat carries a first aid kit with them, and they sing wordlessly to each other. They wear elaborate little business suits all in white with purple trimming, and don\u2019t seem to notice the three interlopers.<br /> <br /> Buildings are clustered closely together, with narrow alleyways forming paths to follow.<br /> <br /> \u201cWelcome to Bucketown\u201d, the Marquesa said.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-28T23:01:03-08:00","id":1498274,"title":"","content":"Halwyn is amazed. He didn't expect the sight. <br /> He eyes the little Hobs, careful not to accidentally step on one while he's looking around. <br /> Graveyards...a slight sting rises in his forehead as he remembers. He was in a graveyard when a huntsman found him and he came out in the same graveyard when he fled from his mistress' realm... now another huntsman of that mistress is after him. <br /> <br /> Anger wells up inside him and his scars begin to glow orange, the sparks from his cloak swirling around a bit. <br /> He tries to calm himself by biting his tongue. &quot;<br /> <br /> Is there a known reason why this is so...morbid?&quot; he asks to distract his thoughts.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-29T09:08:10-08:00","id":1498310,"title":"","content":"The Marquesa replies, \u201cWho knows? The minds of hobs might not as alien as the Gentry, but there\u2019s still no predicting what they\u2019ll do.\u201d<br /> <br /> She takes the two men to another oddity: a candy store, all wrong angles and childish handwriting on the sign above the door reading, <i>Witchypoo\u2019s Candy Store</i>. It looks excessively cramped, especially for two Ogres, but all three squeeze in with surprisingly little trouble.<br /> <br /> Inside the candy shop is a claustrophobic nightmare, walls filled with boxes, display places showing off new candy, and workers\u2014-little gingerbread men helpers going to and fro. Behind the main counter sits a human-sized, humanoid carp, dripping wet and writing quite dexterously for having no hands.<br /> <br /> The Marquesa approaches, and says, \u201cWitchypoo. You remember me? I bring two petitioners who desire answers.\u201d<br /> <br /> Witchypoo adjusts her small spectacles and smiles. \u201c<b><span style=\"color:teal\">Ahhhh....Your Ladyship. Bring two fine specimens to to my store. Mmmm.</span></b>\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-29T14:00:30-08:00","id":1498345,"title":"","content":"He had expected such an answer, which is why he is not disappointed. Maybe he should communicate with Hobs more often...or anyone at all. <br /> <br /> When he sees the building he can't help but turn his head to see if it looks straight from a different angle. <br /> As they enter the store and Halwyn sees all the candy, his stomach begins to growl again. No wonder he hasn't eaten since he started work and even then it was just a small burger. The fact that the workers here look like gingerbread men doesn't make things any better. Still, he holds back from grabbing some of the candy. <br /> <br /> When he is indirectly introduced to Witchypoo, he bows slightly. <br /> <br /> &quot;I'm Hellhound, we have some questions and hope you can answer them&quot; he says politely but fears the price he has to pay.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-29T14:39:13-08:00","id":1498355,"title":"","content":"She cackles as if at some private joke, then beckons Halwyn forward. \u201c<b><span style=\"color:teal\"><i>You</i> have the troubles then, I take it? Come closer. Tell me your tale. What woe befalls you?</span></b>\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-29T15:00:37-08:00","id":1498359,"title":"","content":"Halwyn steps forward. &quot;Yes, basically a lot revolves around me, even if I don't know why. Where do I start?... <br /> <br /> There is a creature in the lake in Ironside that we don't know what it is. But it seems to know about us, a wolf-like creature that should only exist in the ocean or on the shore if the stories are true, <br /> <br /> then there is a human, presumably, asking about me, but I don't know why .<br /> <br /> One guy I met seems to have been coerced by a cult or at least a member of it to turn me in. <br /> <br /> And then there's the Huntsman who was sent after me by my Former Mistress to get me back. ...&quot; <br /> With crossed arms he wonders if he has forgotten something. <br /> &quot;I think those are the things that literally haunt me&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-29T15:19:36-08:00","id":1498363,"title":"","content":"Witchypoo peers carefully into Halwyn\u2019s eyes as he speaks. \u201c<b><span style=\"color:teal\">Lake? You mean Juniper Lake? That\u2019s the only lake I know of, Ironside, that the Marquesa would care about!</span></b><br /> <br /> \u201c<b><span style=\"color:teal\">Yes, yes....I\u2019ve heard things about Juniper Lake. Bodies buried at the bottom, ensnared by muck and silt, their ghosts sing on rainy, moonless nights. I hear them sometimes. They sing of something deeper still than they, and sing that a creature from afar has come to pay the thing beneath Juniper Lake a visit. <i>Quinotaur</i>, the ghosts sing. What that means, I don\u2019t know.</span></b><br /> <br /> \u201c<b><span style=\"color:teal\">To your human interlocutor, are you sure he and the Huntsman sent for you are not the same being?</span></b><br /> <br /> \u201c<b><span style=\"color:teal\">And as for cults, there is a house, Ironside, where men gather. They <i>think</i> of themselves as a religion, but I don\u2019t think belief is what motivates them.</span></b>\u201d<br /> <br /> She gives a long, long pause. \u201c<b><span style=\"color:teal\">A time will come,</span></b>\u201d she says, \u201c<b><span style=\"color:teal\">when I will need lore from <i>you</i>. You will give it to me as I have given to you, yes?</span></b>\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-29T15:38:56-08:00","id":1498366,"title":"","content":"When Witchypoo mentions Juniper Lake, he nods in agreement. <br /> He doesn't dare interrupt her. <br /> His eyes search those of the fortune teller and he tries to remember everything. <br /> <i>Quinotaur</i>,...he absolutely had to remember the word.<br /> The fact that ghosts seem to be trapped in the lake depresses him a bit. <br /> When the seer expresses her assumption about the stranger, he shrugs his shoulders. <br /> It really could be that it was the Huntsman. but he wasn't sure. <br /> <br /> Then there's the cult, he's going to have to talk to Dan about it...and because he wants to help him that the other guy,...Cody, Carl...something with C doesn't threaten him further. <br /> So there's a misconception here in Lambry County...Halwyn hoped that was the least of the problems. <br /> <br /> The payment for this information surprises him. <br /> &quot;You mean I should communicate with ghosts to give you answers or tell you something I've heard or experienced?&quot; Ambiguities were dangerous, whether with a job or with a changeling. &quot;But if it's in my power, I'll give you the lore you want.&quot; He nods determinedly.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-29T15:48:00-08:00","id":1498369,"title":"","content":"She smirks, an odd expression on her alien face. \u201c<b><span style=\"color:teal\">You\u2019re smarter than fae give you credit for.</span></b><br /> <br /> \u201c<b><span style=\"color:teal\">I will not help you against Huntsmen. I won\u2019t lie to you. The Kindly Ones sometimes consult me. I\u2019ll not burn that bridge on just <i>anyone</i>\u2019s behalf.</span></b>\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-29T16:05:04-08:00","id":1498371,"title":"","content":"&quot;Then all I can ask is that you never ask me to tell a friend's secret, or anything that might put one in danger.&quot; <br /> Again he could bite his tongue, he should have put the condition before agreeing. <br /> He has heard from Minos that a Hob rarely takes sides, and even if it worries him, he appreciates the honesty. <br /> <br /> He quickly grabs his notebook and jots down the word before he forgets it. Or is it a name? <i>Quinotaur</i>,...sounds Greek. maybe he should go to a library...or ask Eloi to look it up on the internet. <br /> <br /> He's still debating if there's anything he could ask Witchypoo while he has the chance. &quot;Is there a way for someone like me to communicate with Ghosts?&quot; <br /> If there are ghosts in Juniper Lake, that's a good clue. <br /> Why shouldn't he try to learn something that will help him. &quot;...except with a goblin contract?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-29T16:10:41-08:00","id":1498374,"title":"","content":"Witchypoo strokes her chin thoughtfully. \u201c<b><span style=\"color:teal\"><i>Many</i> means of communication exist, though you, my child, are not adequate to the task. You are a creature of the hunt. You <i>bring</i> death, but you are not <i>of</i> death. It takes effort for ghosts to communicate with those not attuned to them.</span></b><br /> <br /> \u201c<b><span style=\"color:teal\">But all is not lost. In the Estates there is a house without a roof. Here, the barrier between worlds is thin. It may be of use to you. Or perhaps not.</span></b>\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-29T22:59:15-08:00","id":1498402,"title":"","content":"<i>You bring death...</i><br /> That little sentence was like a stab in the heart. Even if it's true, he doesn't like to hear it. He doesn't want to be the hunter, warrior, or killer he was made to be. Helping others, <i>that</i> is what he wants. <br /> <br /> He writes down the building without a roof and thinks about it. Then, audibly but actually to himself, he says &quot;So many ways, but which one should I take first...&quot; then he looks directly at Witchypoo again. &quot;Who is the Huntsman hunting me and how can I get rid of him permanently without harming myself or anyone else?&quot; This question should be neutral enough for the seer without getting into a conflict.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":422,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","user":"Lykas","date":". 11-30-2022, 02:51 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-30T07:55:49-08:00","id":1498439,"title":"","content":"\u201c<b><span style=\"color:teal\">I. Will. <i>Not</i>. Help. You. In this. Regard,</span></b>\u201d Witchypoo says icily.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-30T09:27:55-08:00","id":1498451,"title":"","content":"That answer was loud and clear. Halwyn even winces a little. <br /> &quot;Thanks to you Witchypoo for the insightful information,&quot; he says calmly and kindly. &quot;I wish you a nice time until we meet again&quot; he then turns to Scratch and the Marquessa.<br /> &quot;Do you have anything else you'd like to ask Scratch? If not, I think we're ready to go back.&quot; <br /> <br /> The information in his head is a bit vague and he sincerely hoped that once he had eaten something he would be able to organize everything better and plan his next steps.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-30T09:31:14-08:00","id":1498452,"title":"","content":"Scratch nods. \u201cI do. What IS that wolf, out in Juniper Lake?\u201d<br /> <br /> Witchypoo smiles. \u201c<b><span style=\"color:teal\">I already told you,</span></b>\u201d is all she says.<br /> <br /> Leah says, \u201cLet\u2019s go. I know the roofless house she\u2019s speaking of. If Hellhound will get me a meal at Marcy\u2019s Diner, I\u2019ll drive the two of you out there.\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-30T10:55:19-08:00","id":1498459,"title":"","content":"&quot;But of course we can eat something at Marcy's.&quot; He grins happily. &quot;Of course it's on me.&quot; <br /> He thinks for a moment. &quot;Would you mind if we get the food and then drive over to my place to eat? I'd like to avoid questions from Marcy or my colleagues. <br /> It's less than ten minutes by car from the diner.&quot; He looks at the two questioningly.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-30T12:09:59-08:00","id":1498464,"title":"","content":"Both nod in accordance. They leave, and Witchypoo gives them a little wave as they go.<br /> <br /> Leah sighs. \u201cThat went better than I thought it would. She\u2019s <i>not</i> a hob. Whatever she was prior to becoming a Goblin Queen is...unclear.\u201d<br /> <br /> They retreat to Earth, thankfully uneventfully, and then eat their promised meal. As they eat, the Marquesa says, \u201cThis house Witchypoo mentioned. I know of it. Teenage wannabe-pagans meet there every Saturday. Surprisingly, nothing\u2019s snatched them up, yet.<br /> <br /> \u201cAs to the house, it was literally never completed. The roof was never added on. As a result, weather gets in: Wood is rotten, ground is mud, critters nest in it, somewhere, sometimes. But, it\u2019s said shedding blood there will sometimes allow a ghost to speak with you\u2014-assuming a ghost is nearby, that is. Which there\u2019s no guarantee of.\u201d She takes a swig of her Dr. Pepper. \u201cNever put much credit to it, but if Witchypoo says its real, then...I guess...\u201d<br /> <br /> She further looks on her cellphone. \u201cAh. Here we are. <i>Quinotaur</i>, a creature from folklore. <i>Not</i> a wolf, though. Rather, the front half is a bull, the back half is a giant fish tail.\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12219,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","user":"Demigod Beast","date":". 11-30-2022, 03:23 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-30T12:55:07-08:00","id":1498465,"title":"","content":"&quot;Minos never told me about a goblin queen. Maybe they didn't know any...&quot; replies Halwyn. <br /> <br /> The caravan is small but cozy. The three sit together around a table that easily seats seven people. The interior is heated, although Halwyn doesn't normally need it. His bed, which he hadn't made this morning, was closed with a curtain. It's not messy, but you can tell Halwyn rarely if ever has guests here. Halwyn plugs his cell phone in and hopes it's finally charging again. <br /> <br /> &quot;I really hope that the kids only show up there on Saturdays. I don't want to attract more attention than necessary. I wonder which ghosts you meet there and whether they can really help.&quot; With a look out of the window, he fixes on the playground that can be seen in the distance, which is also said to be haunted. <br /> <br /> &quot;Does the rumor say it must be own blood or something else?&quot; He didn't want to sacrifice an animal or anything. <br /> <br /> He listens to Leah. &quot;A creature from folklore? Of what origin? Also native? Sounds more European like centaur or minotaur...&quot; he grabs his notebook and adds the information to the name of the creature. &quot;Why does a bullfish seek out an underwater wolf...&quot; he then asks into the room as he pulls out the Bluefingers book and looks there for the Kin of Tar. &quot;Demonic wolves of the ocean...fish with the front end of a bull...can't figure it out yet...&quot; he massages his temples. &quot;...big rock markers under the tide...I doubt I can dive deep enough to see if there's a rock like that in the lake.&quot; he laughs briefly. <br /> &quot;But I could have one...&quot; he seems to have an idea. &quot;Well first we should visit the house with no roof...After all, a Ghost <i>might</i> have answers there. When not about the creatures in the lake, maybe about the Huntsman.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-30T13:05:11-08:00","id":1498466,"title":"","content":"Scratch speaks up. \u201cI \u2018magine ghosts are like anybody, Hellhound. Some are helpful. Some are stupid shits. It sounds like luck a\u2019 th\u2019 draw, to me.\u201d<br /> <br /> Leah thinks a moment. \u201cDunno about the blood. Presumably it\u2019d be the one seeking answers. But who knows. Witchypoo could have told us, but she didn\u2019t.\u201d<br /> <br /> Scratch sneers, \u201cThat bitch just wants to see us squirm.\u201d<br /> <br /> Leah nods. \u201cMaybe.\u201d She turns to Halwyn. \u201cWhat\u2019s this about a rock marker? Could be a land deed. They used to do that sort of things, a great many moons ago.\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-30T13:24:56-08:00","id":1498467,"title":"","content":"&quot;Well then, let's hope for a helpful ghost.&quot; He replies positively to Scratch's comment. <br /> <br /> &quot;Then let's try our own blood first, otherwise we'll have to grab one of the Pagan kids and convince him to answer. It won't be long until Saturday.&quot; <br /> <br /> &quot;It says here in the book that those demon wolves keep rocks like that in the water below...it just doesn't seem clear why. <br /> Maybe there are some of those markers out there outside the lake that could give us a clue.&quot; <br /> He gets up and searches his little library, which consists of a few novels and some comics. In between, he then finds his map of Lambry County. <br /> &quot;Scratch, do you remember exactly where we met the wolf?&quot; He hands him a pen. &quot;Oh and where is Dan's house? I have to find my car...it's not too far from his cabin&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-30T13:37:46-08:00","id":1498468,"title":"","content":"\u201cI could take you there,\u201d Scratch offers. \u201cBoth places, actually.\u201d<br /> <br /> Leah grows still. \u201cProbably not a land deed then,\u201d she concludes, \u201cif demonic entities are involved. <i>Under</i> the lake, you say?\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12219,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","user":"Demigod Beast","date":". 11-30-2022, 04:55 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-30T13:59:00-08:00","id":1498469,"title":"","content":"&quot;I accept the offer. I hope my car didn't suffers to much damage...the last repair was expensive...&quot; He snorts. <br /> <br /> &quot;I can't quite read here if these are markers put up by the beings themselves or by the natives they were worshiped...if the demons put them up themselves then there will be no landmarks, but if they're put up by humans, there may be some outside as well. And I think it may be that they were built in a pattern then. Do you know of any special rocks in the area? I don't know of any unfortunately.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-30T14:11:58-08:00","id":1498470,"title":"","content":"Both fae shake their heads no.<br /> <br /> The Marquesa\u2019s cellphone rings. \u201cYes?\u201d Leah answers. \u201cOh? Oh! Shit! That\u2019s right! No, no, everything\u2019s fine. I\u2019ll be right over.\u201d She hangs up. \u201cBig freehold Winter holiday coming up. Unique to the House Up On The Hill. Scratch knows about it, but you, you\u2019re new. It\u2019s called the Lepers\u2019 Dance, and we invite the impoverished in the area to come up and have soup with us. Father will say some sort of religious thing or another, probably, and my siblings will be their usual pains in the asses. Afterwards will be a candlelight vigil just for <i>us</i> Lost.\u201d<br /> <br /> She gathers up her things. \u201cAnyhow, I have to go. Scratch. You\u2019re up at the freehold, your truck; want me to drop you two off?\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-30T14:37:18-08:00","id":1498472,"title":"","content":"Impoverished people getting soup and listening to religious texts... Something in Halwyn's mind is ringing. He himself was one of those impoverished people in his youth, back in Ireland. &quot;It's a nice tradition,&quot; he says curtly. <br /> &quot;When does the festival start?&quot; <br /> <br /> Halwyn looks at Scratch, then nods to the Marquessa. &quot;I would like at least to know that my car is safe today before it's too late&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-30T14:45:04-08:00","id":1498473,"title":"","content":"Leah says, \u201cWe still have a few days. And don\u2019t worry, Father keeps the religious talk as neutral as possible. The purpose is to nourish others facing sorrows, not rant and rave at them. Anyhow, let\u2019s go.\u201d<br /> <br /> The three pile into Leah\u2019s rather nice car and off they go. They see a wreck along the way: a car slid on black ice and plowed gently into a telephone poll. Fire department is on hand, with an ambulance. Thankfully, it appears and injuries are minimal, at worst. The three continue onwards.<br /> <br /> At the freehold, Father is waiting outside for the Marquesa. He wears heavy clothing, and is smoking a cigar. All three jump out at the vehicle. Leah turns to Halwyn. \u201cI hope i was able to help. And don\u2019t worry, we\u2019re on high alert. That Huntsman might not be here <i>just</i> for you, you know.\u201d<br /> <br /> The two Ogres pile into Scratch\u2019s truck. \u201cYour car, first?\u201d Scratch asks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-30T15:04:05-08:00","id":1498474,"title":"","content":"&quot;I was raised strictly Protestant as a child. I must have heard every single verse in the Bible several times, even if I wasn't that interested in it.&quot; <br /> <br /> When he sees the crashed car, he swallows. The snow and ice are getting more and more dangerous as it looks. Was it the normal weather or is it the Huntsman's fault...after all, he comes from his mistress...his former mistress. <br /> <br /> Halwyn bows slightly &quot;You've been a great help.<br /> I haven't figured it out yet, but I've found a lot of puzzle pieces that could help me further.&quot; <br /> He flinches &quot;That's right, the Huntsman could also look for other victims...I didn't even think of that&quot; his eyes wander across the floor. <br /> &quot;If there's anything I can do for the festival, let me know. Maybe I can inspire Marcy to donate to those in need. I'm sure she has a good heart and at the moment fewer guests are coming because of the weather, so that some food remains.&quot; <br /> <br /> Halwyn pauses, &quot;Yes, I think it would be a good idea to check my car first. As far as I know, ghosts can only appear at night.&quot; He wants to look for the time at his cell phone, but realizes that he forgot it in the caravan.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-30T15:08:42-08:00","id":1498475,"title":"","content":"Both men pile into the truck and off they go. Country music blares on the radio.<br /> <br /> Upon arriving....his car is <i>gone</i>. The German Shepherd from before has reappeared, along with his owner, a homely woman in her late 40s. The dog is on a leash and is clearly sniffing for a place to do his business. When both men exit the truck, the lady says, \u201cOne a\u2019 you fellas had the car? Got towed. Sorry.\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-30T15:23:04-08:00","id":1498477,"title":"","content":"He nods his thanks to the woman. <br /> &quot;Damn...Scratch do you know where they take towed cars? Otherwise we'd have to ask Dan which service he called. Today really is a day like no other...&quot; He rubs his hand over his head and pulls lightly on his hair.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-30T15:27:03-08:00","id":1498478,"title":"","content":"Before Scratch can answer, the lady replies, \u201cLambry Police Station. They only have your car for less\u2019n a day, probably still out there.\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-30T23:16:17-08:00","id":1498502,"title":"","content":"&quot;Then we have to go to the police...&quot; He tries to laugh a little, but it sounds desperate. &quot;Thank you, good lady&quot; he makes a slight bow. <br /> <br /> &quot;Glad I didn't leave my passport in the car,&quot; he says to Scratch, just shaking his head. &quot;Then let's go. Not that they'll take the car to the junkyard if I don't pick it up.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-02T12:55:48-08:00","id":1498630,"title":"","content":"[OOC: I am sick as a dog. Coughing, phlegm, the whole nine yards. I\u2019ll take a few days off....no heavy thinking. Don\u2019t worry, we\u2019ll get back to it as soon as I feel better.]","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-02T13:44:13-08:00","id":1498634,"title":"","content":"[OOC: I hope you get well soon. Thanks for letting me know.]","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-04T14:01:50-08:00","id":1498794,"title":"","content":"[OOC: Ok, I\u2019m recovering quickly. Tomorrow, we\u2019ll start this up again. Thanks for being patient, man!]","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-05T08:24:03-08:00","id":1498863,"title":"","content":"Scratch nods. As the two men walk back to Scratch\u2019s truck, Scratch asks, \u201cWhat \u2018bout that Dan guy? Y\u2019said you wanted to talk to him, too.\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-05T12:42:57-08:00","id":1498878,"title":"","content":"&quot;I wanted to ask him who might have picked up my car,&quot; Halwyn replies to Scratch's question. <br /> &quot;And because of this cult...but I hope that this isn't an acute issue now...&quot; he scratches his head again. <br /> &quot;Unless this cult has something to do with the wolf demon...&quot; His fingers massage the bridge of his nose. &quot;Yeah, we should ask him about this cult and then about the hut without a roof. If there is a cult here, then the pagan kids might have something to do with it...&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-05T12:53:39-08:00","id":1498879,"title":"","content":"[OOC: By the way, thank you kindly for being patient. I appreciate it, I really do.]<br /> <br /> Finding Dan\u2019s house is easy, but the man\u2019s expression turns apprehensive when he sees who it is knocking at his door.<br /> <br /> \u201cUm, forget something?\u201d he hesitantly asks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-05T14:32:43-08:00","id":1498888,"title":"","content":"[OOC: No problem, private life can always get in the way, whether it's illness or something else. I like the play and I can wait a bit for an answer.] <br /> <br /> Halwyn takes a deep breath. &quot;May I come in for a moment?&quot; He doesn't even wait for an answer but enters Dan's house. &quot;I didn't really forget anything, but I wanted to ask you something...about this cult of your...blackmailer. What kind of cult is it? Why is he after me. I need to know what for trouble I could get stuck in.&quot; his voice sounds serious and he tries not to allow any resistance. <br /> &quot;You have to tell me everything you know about it. f you're in danger...I'll find a way to protect you...I promise.&quot; Not accidentally spoken this time, Halwyn means what he says.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-05T14:59:21-08:00","id":1498893,"title":"","content":"Dan hesitates for a long, long, <i>long</i> moment. Then he waves Scratch and Halwyn in. He invites them to sit in his Spartan living room and gets a glass of water for each man. Dan sits down opposite of them in a recliner and sighs a long, drawn out sigh.<br /> <br /> \u201cWhere to start?\u201d He muses. \u201cCale belongs to the Church of the Fisher of Men. It\u2019s a Bible reference; \u2018Come with me and I will make you fishers of men\u2019. We, um, met a local, um, bar, and he invited me out. Said his church was totally LBGT-accepting. Really tried to get me as invested as possible.<br /> <br /> \u201cBut, um, well, they have this preacher, this guy named Luther Wolfe. This guy is....well, <i>insane</i>. He preaches some really weird stuff. Mixed in his Christian theology were references to Atlantis and \u2018the angels of the deep\u2019 and holy bloodlines, and all that. He controlled EVERYTHING, even who you married.<br /> <br /> \u201cAfter a few months, stuff just got too weird, and when I was offered the job here studying at Juniper Lake, I jumped at the chance.<br /> <br /> \u201cWhat I didn\u2019t anticipate was Cale tracking me down and harassing me.\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-05T23:29:19-08:00","id":1498920,"title":"","content":"Halwyn sits down and takes his glass of water, but doesn't drink. Not that he doesn't trust Dan, but he wants to make sure first. <br /> <br /> When Dan tells his story, Halwyn nods again and again and only looks surprised when he tells about Atlantis and the angel. He once heard of Atlantis, some lost city that hasn't been found yet... before he was kidnapped. <br /> <br /> And again something from the depths... do the angel, the wolf and the bull fish have something to do with each other? <br /> But one thing bothers him about the idea. <br /> &quot;So this church isn't here in Lambry County, just this Cole guy...then who were you on the phone with? Who weren't you turning me over to?...&quot; Before Dan could ask, Halwyn tapped his ears. &quot;I have really good hearing from time to time and you were just...&quot; he thinks for a moment, yes all that has happened today so far &quot;...you were acting strange earlier.&quot; <br /> He relaxes his whole body and tries to look as unthreatening as possible. &quot;Who's after me? And why?&quot; he smiles at Dan. &quot;You have to tell me... and if that gets you in trouble, I'll bang out of there.&quot; he tenses his arm muscles on the last sentence, as if he meant it literally.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-06T05:07:42-08:00","id":1498938,"title":"","content":"[OOC: Up waaaaaay early, today.]<br /> <br /> Dan shakes his head. \u201cNo. The Church isn\u2019t here. Cale followed me. I\u2019m...pretty sure he\u2019s obsessed. Or something. I\u2019m not sure.<br /> <br /> \u201cAnd that was Cale on the phone. He wondered who \u2018the dog\u2019\u2014-his words, not mine\u2014-was. He tried that blackmail bull crap, but I told him off. Who knows? Maybe I\u2019m better off, if everyone knew. He said something about a debt denied, or something. \u2018Stone under the water\u2019, yadda, yadda, yadda. Typical Church of the Fisher of Men pseudo-mysticism.<br /> <br /> \u201cAnd all I know about Cale himself is he belonged to this fraternal order, um, the Lodge of Odo-something.\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-06T05:52:24-08:00","id":1498941,"title":"","content":"[OOC: I'm on my lunch break right now \ud83d\ude05] <br /> <br /> &quot;If he gets too close to you again, let me know...I'll give you mine...&quot; The long hiss of his breath as he forces his teeth through his teeth is frightening. &quot;<br /> ...ahh I got it...&quot; He digs out his notebook, looks for his number and writes it down on an extra page, which he rips out and hands to Dan. <br /> You can call me anytime. I also try to keep my phone with me. In an emergency call the diner&quot; he also writes the number behind it, the only one he knows by heart so far, but only because it's very simple. <br /> <br /> &quot;If he keeps bothering you, the <i>dog</i> will show him his Teeth.&quot; <br /> He thinks for a moment. &quot;Would it be so bad if everyone knew? Those who turn their backs on you are not the kind of people you should be around... But I can't give you proper advice, unfortunately&quot; <i>'Debt denied, Stone under the water, Lodge of Odo.. .'</i> he writes these terms down. Even though the church isn't here, Cale seems to have something to do with it. <i>Lodge of Odo something...</i> &quot;could it be called <i>Lodge of Quinotaur</i>?&quot; It didn't sound like it, but if someone could only have read it, then it could be. He looks at Dan questioningly.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-06T06:13:29-08:00","id":1498945,"title":"","content":"Dan shrugs helplessly. \u201cI\u2019m from a deeply conservative Christian home. I went to Church <i>every</i> Sunday. I...was raised with the idea these...inclinations...were evil.\u201d He sighs. \u201cI know better <i>now</i>, of course...\u201d<br /> <br /> He\u2019s silent for a moment. \u201cI was <i>so</i> looking forward to working here, too. Juniper Lake has some <i>bizarre</i> wildlife in it. Not, like, a three-eyed Simpsons fish, but <i>weird</i>. It\u2019s all so...<i>intriguing</i>. Then Cale showed up. Now things\u2019ve turned to poo.\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-06T08:59:21-08:00","id":1498959,"title":"","content":"Halwyn knows christian parenting all too well, but the subject was never discussed. He was sure his aunt would damn it, but he still had no relation to it. He also didn't know anyone who was queer, except for Dan now...at least he thinks so. Still, he feels like he would understand Dan.<br /> <br /> &quot;We will find a way to make things better for you. A way that Cale will keep you happy and keep the job you like.&quot; Even if he doesn't trust the lake thing. &quot;Trust me.&quot; Then he turns to Scratch. &quot;Can you think of anything else I might have missed?&quot; He looks in his notebook, &quot;If not, then we'll have to move on, it's getting late.&quot; <br /> <br /> &quot;Promise me you'll get in touch if Cale bothers you again.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-06T09:08:02-08:00","id":1498960,"title":"","content":"Dan nods, and they exchange phone numbers.<br /> <br /> Scratch says, in a quiet voice, \u201cWe need to go, Hal.\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-06T09:15:28-08:00","id":1498962,"title":"","content":"Halwyn offers Dan his hand in farewell and starts off with Scratch. <br /> <br /> On the way to Scratch's truck, he asks him &quot;What do you think, this church and this Cale...could they have anything to do with the Damon? He mentioned something about the stone under the water, like the book... .&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-06T09:34:23-08:00","id":1498964,"title":"","content":"As they climb into the truck, in a quiet voice, Scratch says, \u201cThe wolf said they\u2019d carve my name in stone, and the \u2018debt\u2019 they owed me.\u201d He starts up the truck. \u201cI\u2019m thinkin\u2019 I was gonna sacrificed, like outta some bad horror movie.\u201d<br /> <br /> As they pull out, Scratch asks, \u201cWhat now? I got about two hours before my shift at the freehold starts.\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-06T10:35:39-08:00","id":1498971,"title":"","content":"&quot;The best thing is if you drop me off at the police station so I can get my car. Can you tell me exactly where you made the pact with the demon? I'll go and see if I have anything interesting there tomorrow. <br /> And if you're free tomorrow, can you lead me to the hut without a roof? Otherwise, you can mark it for me on a map, it can't be that difficult to find.&quot; <br /> <br /> Halwyn unconsciously taps his knee with his thumb as he continues to ponder what else he might aim for.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-06T10:52:23-08:00","id":1498972,"title":"","content":"Scratch nods. They begin to drive. \u201cMet the damn thing on pier #3, down on the lake\u2019s western shore. Only pier there, on the west end a\u2019Juniper. Thing just leapt up onto the deck, and started talkin\u2019. I was absolutely alone...<i>and</i> it was rainin\u2019. No Glamour comin\u2019 off it. It has a, a <i>solidness</i> to it most hobs don\u2019t got.<br /> <br /> \u201cAnd, yeah, I can take you to the roofless house.\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-06T11:19:35-08:00","id":1498975,"title":"","content":"&quot;Then I hope that it does not rain tomorrow. Surely the wolf is not good to talk to me.&quot; <br /> A tormented smile lies on his lips. &quot;Then call me tomorrow, when best suits you&quot; <br /> He looks out of the window. &quot;I'm swirring so much by the head ... it's scary, how much suddenly happens.&quot; Then he looks to Scratch, &quot;You know? Actually, I wanted to lose the day today only in bed and maybe in the afternoon grill something ... Well, it's always different than planned.&quot; He laughs short","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-06T11:37:06-08:00","id":1498977,"title":"","content":"Scratch. \u201cI hear ya. Right now, though, a Huntsman\u2019s a\u2019huntin\u2019. We ain\u2019t got no time for relaxation. \u2018Sides, what makes you think Danny-boy has anything to do with this whole thing? Scientists study shit. It\u2019s what they do.\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-06T11:56:41-08:00","id":1498982,"title":"","content":"&quot;I don't think Dan has anything to do with it directly, it's his ex-lover, this Cale. You heard he's part of that cult with the underwater angel. Maybe it has something to do with that bullfish that the Seer talked, that quinotaur. After all, he's supposed to pay the demon a visit. Maybe it's just coincidence that Dan has a job here, or it was all planned by that Luther Wolfe or whatever his name is. <br /> <br /> I hope I can find something about this church on the internet. Or about this lodge...&quot; he exhales heavily.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-06T12:11:28-08:00","id":1498983,"title":"","content":"Scratch snorts. \u201cDon\u2019t count on it. Secret societies like this \u2018lodge\u2019 are really big on hush-hush hidden shit. Helps generate publicity.\u201d<br /> <br /> After dropping Halwyn off at the police station, the cops return his car to him, telling Halwyn he needs to give his insurance company a call, otherwise, expensive repairs\u2019re going to be necessary.<br /> <br /> The car\u2019s still drivable...thankfully.<br /> <br /> [OOC: Alright What now?]","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-06T12:40:27-08:00","id":1498984,"title":"","content":"Halwyn makes sure the car is drivable and breathes a sigh of relief. <br /> On the way home he drives carefully this time. Once there, he checks his phone to see if anyone has texted or called him. <br /> <br /> He clears away the leftovers from the meal and sits down at the table to fire up the laptop he has. <br /> &quot;Let's see what I May find,&quot; he murmurs to himself before typing in his keywords. <br /> <i>Quinotaur, <br /> Church of the Fishermen, <br /> Luther Wolfe, <br /> Kin of Tar, <br /> Lodge of Obo...</i> <br /> However, the flickering of the screen quickly gets on his nerves. Again he reaches for his notebook and looks for Eloi's email address, he's sure he's written it down and he writes the terms into a message he sends him. &quot;Maybe he'll find out more,&quot; he says into the room. <br /> <br /> After a relaxing shower, he looks at his duty roster and writes to Marcy whether the early shift will remain tomorrow. Then he goes to bed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-06T13:02:06-08:00","id":1498986,"title":"","content":"The results from the search are varied, to be simplistic, when Eloi fires back a response a half hour later.<br /> <br /> <i>Quinotaur</i><br /> <b>Creature of medieval European folklore, the quinotaur was said to have the front half of a bull and the back half of a fish.</b><br /> <br /> <i>Church of the Fisher of Men</i><br /> <b>No results.</b><br /> <br /> <i>Luther Wolf</i><br /> <b>Full name Luther Anders Wolf. American Minister. Church unknown. Divorced twice. Extensive criminal history, mostly fraud, blackmail and money laundering. Served ten years behind bars.</b><br /> <br /> <i>Kin of Tar</i><br /> <b>No results.</b><br /> <br /> <i>Lodge of Obo</i><br /> <b>No results.<br /> Did you mean Lodge of Oda? Liberian pro-wrestling school. Known for frequent financial scandals.<br /> Did you mean Lodge of Odacon? American West Coast-based neo-pagan movement.<br /> Did you mean Lodge of Odo? If so, no results.<br /> Did you mean Lodge of Otha? Writing circle for believers of the Baha\u2019i religion.<br /> Did you mean Lodge of Otho? No results.<br /> <br /> Will keep looking.<br /> Eloi</b>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-06T13:24:55-08:00","id":1498988,"title":"","content":"Halwyn checks the results Eloi sends him. No surprise, except for the life of this Luther Wolfe. Although, that a cult leader has a long list of criminal activities doesn't surprise him that much. <br /> <br /> <b>Unfortunately I don't know the exact name of the lodge</b> <br /> he replies <br /> <b>The lodge is said to be a fraternal order and the church worships an angel from the deep. Maybe atlantean stuff <br /> Thanks to you <br /> Hellhound</b> <br /> <br /> Before he goes to sleep, he looks whether Marcy wrote back.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-06T13:50:02-08:00","id":1498989,"title":"","content":"A text comes in from Eloi. It reads:<br /> <br /> <i>This text will be deleted magically in a few minutes, so read quickly.<br /> <br /> You mentioned Atlantis? I\u2019ve heard of a group of artifact-hunters called the Aegis Kai Doru. They claim to be of Atlantean descent, and Wolfe\u2019s father Lucas was a known associate.<br /> <br /> You\u2019re getting into some crazy waters.<br /> <br /> Stay safe.<br /> Eloi</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-06T15:20:31-08:00","id":1498999,"title":"","content":"More weird cults...<i>Aegis Kai Doru</i>...sounds strange to Halwyn as he speaks the words. <br /> Artifact Hunter... At the moment it seemed like he was attracting really crazy things like a magnet. <br /> <br /> Even if Eloi writes that the text will be deleted, he at least writes down the names of these hunters in his book. Who knows when he would need the info. <br /> <br /> In bed he looks at his cell phone again, sets an early alarm and falls asleep. <br /> <br /> <br /> The next morning, after taking another shower, he gets ready for the morning shift at the diner. Outside, he takes another close look at his car. He really needs to call the insurance company, it looks like what he's doing for his break. He walks to dinner, despite the cold. Again the question arises whether the snow and the cold are normal here or whether it is caused by the huntsman. Arriving at the diner, he greets Marcy. He's kind of happy to see his boss, she always puts his mind at ease with her manner and looks. After a quick look to see which guests have already arrived, he goes straight into the kitchen, puts on his apron and takes care of the pending orders. Again and again he looks out to see if anyone he knows is there...whether from Freehold or from the area itself. <br /> <br /> He's also pondering his next steps. When his shift is over, he goes to said pier where Scratch met the wolf. He then plans to go to a copy shop to copy the pages from the book before driving to House Up On The Hill to bring it back. Perhaps there is already information for him there. Later in the day, when it gets dark, he wants to go to the roofless house. <br /> What he can do in the meantime, he has no idea.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-06T15:41:26-08:00","id":1499002,"title":"","content":"Work goes pleasantly placidly, and Halwyn loses himself in the comforting routine. Marcy\u2019s daughter is coming in, tomorrow, and she informs Halwyn, the Diner will be closed for the next two days.<br /> <br /> It\u2019s early afternoon by the time he makes it back to Juniper Lake. The snow is gently falling, and sound is subdued. The pier in question is still being maintained, but looks like nature has taken her toll from it already. A giant wood and concrete behemoth, it goes quite a way out over the water. There\u2019s a ladder to climb down into the lake, but obviously it\u2019s been chained off. It\u2019s a meter-and-a-half drop from the pier, that water.<br /> <br /> It\u2019s all so still and beautiful.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-07T03:59:37-08:00","id":1499049,"title":"","content":"Two days off? That's a good thing. He resists asking why, he can guess given the small number of customers because of the weather. <br /> <br /> The pier is a bit too quiet for him. He walks cautiously along the pier, constantly shifting his gaze between his next step and the surface of the water. When he gets to the chain he looks deeper into the water to make sure there is nothing lurking there. Then he closes his eyes and tries to scent unusual smells.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-07T09:39:06-08:00","id":1499072,"title":"","content":"[OOC: Wits + Survival. Just looked at your character sheet again; you do indeed have the Acute Senses Merit!]","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12219,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","user":"Demigod Beast","date":". 12-07-2022, 12:41 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-07T09:59:40-08:00","id":1499073,"title":"","content":"[OOC:<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://roll.coyotecode.net/lookup.php?rollid=272625\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"http://roll.coyotecode.net/images/logo.gif\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://roll.coyotecode.net/lookup.php?rollid=272625\" target=\"_blank\"> CoyoteCode Dice Roller </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://roll.coyotecode.net/lookup.php?rollid=272625\" target=\"_blank\"> http://roll.coyotecode.net/lookup.php?rollid=272625 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> One success<br /> <br /> <br /> The last rolls I forgot about the merit \ud83d\ude05]","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-07T10:08:06-08:00","id":1499074,"title":"","content":"Halwyn closes his eyes, and listens: the freezing wind howling like a homeless dog, the ice of Lake Juniper cracking like ice in someone\u2019s drink in the club...and the distinct smell of wet dog. It\u2019s <i>everywhere</i>. Unfortunately, snowfall obliterated any physical trace, but there ARE signs of something rooting around the garbage cans at the base of the dock. Unlikely to be sea-demons, but still.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-07T10:24:14-08:00","id":1499076,"title":"","content":"He opens his eyes again and moves cautiously towards the garbage cans. <br /> His muscles tense. No matter what might be there, whether it's a normal dog, a homeless man, or a mini demon pup, Halwyn doesn't want to be caught off guard. He already has his lighter in his hand.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-07T10:53:01-08:00","id":1499079,"title":"","content":"It quickly becomes apparent it\u2019s just raccoons. Despite the snow, their little paw prints are still visible.<br /> <br /> Behind him, Halwyn hears a man light a cigarette. \u201cRaccoons,\u201d the man says. \u201cLittle bastards are everywhere right now.\u201d<br /> <br /> Halwyn sees behind himself stands a tall, thin man, well over two meters tall, wearing a heavy winter coat and thick workman\u2019s jeans. He wore boots explicitly made for icy environs. The man extends his hand. \u201cName\u2019s Emmet. I groundskeep this part of the shore. Easy work in winter, so few people come down here.<br /> <br /> \u201cSay, you that Dan guy I was told was coming? I was off yesterday, so I missed you. Pleased to finally meet you.\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12219,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","user":"Demigod Beast","date":". 12-07-2022, 02:03 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-07T11:33:39-08:00","id":1499081,"title":"","content":"When he sees the traces, he is secretly glad that they are only mundane traces. <br /> He slowly turns around and looks at the stranger. &quot;I don't think I've ever seen one of the critters in real life.&quot; He replies. <br /> When the stranger gives him his hand, he first looks at it, then up at him again. It's rare that he meets someone taller than himself. He takes the hand and shakes it. &quot;I'm sorry to disappoint you, my name is Halwyn. But I know a Dan who's researching some aquatic animals around here. Maybe you are waiting for him?<br /> Actualy I'm looking for something a friend may have lost here recently. Have you seen a hip flask, it's made of leather on the outside with engraving on it? <br /> <br /> [OOC: I took the freedom of rolling Manipulation+Subterfuge cause of the Lie.<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://roll.coyotecode.net/lookup.php?rollid=272630\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"http://roll.coyotecode.net/images/logo.gif\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://roll.coyotecode.net/lookup.php?rollid=272630\" target=\"_blank\"> CoyoteCode Dice Roller </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://roll.coyotecode.net/lookup.php?rollid=272630\" target=\"_blank\"> http://roll.coyotecode.net/lookup.php?rollid=272630 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://roll.coyotecode.net/lookup.php?rollid=272631\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"http://roll.coyotecode.net/images/logo.gif\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://roll.coyotecode.net/lookup.php?rollid=272631\" target=\"_blank\"> CoyoteCode Dice Roller </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://roll.coyotecode.net/lookup.php?rollid=272631\" target=\"_blank\"> http://roll.coyotecode.net/lookup.php?rollid=272631 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> Two successes]","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-07T11:42:32-08:00","id":1499082,"title":"","content":"Emmet puffed a few times on his cigarette. \u201cFucking thieves. That\u2019s what raccoons are. Say! I know you now! You\u2019re the short order cook at Marcy\u2019s!<br /> <br /> \u201cAs for a hip flask, no, can\u2019t say I have.\u201d He chuckles. \u201c\u2018Least you ain\u2019t another tabloid reporter looking for the something \u2018Atlantean\u2019. No! I shit you not! A rumor\u2019s been floating around for <i>years</i> something from <i>Atlantis</i> ended up at the bottom of Juniper Lake.\u201d He snorts. \u201cFucking morons.\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-07T11:52:04-08:00","id":1499083,"title":"","content":"&quot;Yes, that's exactly who I am. You're a customer of ours? Can't say I've seen you before...but I'm usually in the kitchen at the back.&quot; <br /> <br /> He kicks away some snow. &quot;Do raccoons steal glittery things too?&quot; he laughs briefly. <br /> <br /> <i>Atlantis?</i> Like the lost city? No way. Why on earth should there be any of that here? We're far away from...everything&quot; He laughs again. &quot;How often do you get annoyed by reporters...&quot; he uses his fingers to make quotation marks &quot;...like that?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-07T12:02:42-08:00","id":1499086,"title":"","content":"Emmet shrugs. \u201cEvery few months, some crackpot\u2019ll drift in, all excited. They get scuba gear, bring all sorts of fancy equipment, document <i>everything</i> and find nothing. <i>Nothing</i>.<br /> <br /> \u201cSome fraternal order owns the rights to survey the lake. They charge a pretty penny for morons looking to waste their hard-earned money chasing down faerie tales. Doesn\u2019t matter how many of these douch-nozzels come back empty handed, more eventually trot their way up, eager to be disappointed in turn.\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-07T12:14:46-08:00","id":1499089,"title":"","content":"&quot;Sounds even beyond silly&quot; Halwyn laughs, since he actually means it. <br /> &quot;Any idea why the rumor has persisted for so long? I mean, if nobody ever finds anything, then there can't be anything.&quot; <br /> <br /> Then he scratches his head. &quot;You say a fraternal order? Do you know what it's called? I heard from someone about a Lodge of Obo..Something that's supposed to be here.&quot; <br /> He continues to look around to see if he can find the <i>flask</i>. In truth, he is looking for traces that can point to the demon. Under all the snow, however, it seems impossible to him.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-07T12:36:04-08:00","id":1499091,"title":"","content":"\u201cThe Lodge of Odacon,\u201d Emmet corrects. \u201cSome Freemasons-offshoot, or something.\u201d He looks out over the ice. \u201cBe careful at the lake. Ice is deceptively thin.\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-07T12:43:34-08:00","id":1499093,"title":"","content":"&quot;Freemasons? Oh man, maybe I should look for such conspiracies after all. Is there a Yeti here too?&quot; His laughter can be heard loudly. <br /> <br /> &quot;No don't worry, I don't want to go in the ice, I'm definitely too heavy for that&quot; <i>and too hot</i> he thinks to himself. <br /> &quot;I'm still looking around the shore, where would an old drunk who isn't good at climbing go here?&quot; he asks Emmet. &quot;<br /> Oh and if I meet Dan, should I tell him something?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-07T12:52:06-08:00","id":1499095,"title":"","content":"\u201cWhere would a drug go to be alone? You were just out there friend. Nobody uses #3 anymore. Don\u2019t know why.<br /> <br /> \u201cAs for Dan? Tell him if he finds something weird, name after me.\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-07T13:27:00-08:00","id":1499098,"title":"","content":"&quot;Okay, I'll tell him that. Maybe see you at the diner.&quot; He salutes Emmet with two fingers, looks around as an alibi and then slowly walks to his car. <br /> In it he immediately grabs his notebook and writes down the <i>Lodge of Odacon</i>. <br /> <br /> The engine almost revs up when he turns the key and it takes a couple of tries for it to pull away. <br /> &quot;It's okay, we'll see if we can find a workshop that's good for you.&quot; he says to the car. He stops again, picks up his phone and punches in Eloi's number. &quot;Maybe there is a mechanic among us&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-07T13:40:03-08:00","id":1499100,"title":"","content":"When Eloi answers, Halwyn can hear metal music rapidly decrease in volume. \u201cWhat,\u201d the Darkling snaps.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-07T22:55:22-08:00","id":1499125,"title":"","content":"&quot;Hey, this is Hellhound. Sorry to bother you, but I don't know myself right now, do we have a mechanic at the Freehold? So someone who knows about cars? <br /> And can you maybe find me a picture of a man. His first name is Cale he's a member of the Lodge of Odacon, he's probably from Seattle and he's in Lambry County right now Hmm...I think he's gay or at least pretends to be gay so maybe that will help with the search.&quot; <br /> While he's on the phone, he routinely checks his car to make sure everything's still there.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-08T09:09:57-08:00","id":1499146,"title":"","content":"\u201cA mechanic? You\u2019re talking to him. Ha! Heard you busted up your ride. Bring it in. I\u2019ll look at it, when I have time. As to the other things, I\u2019ve got no time. Huntsman on the prowl. Freehold defense\u2019s come first. Sorry!\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-08T10:06:54-08:00","id":1499149,"title":"","content":"&quot;Ah cool, I'll drop in on that then. <br /> Yes, of course that has priority.<br /> It looks like the Huntsman was sent by my keeper. I don't know if it matters but he's theoretically from Ireland, if that helps in any way.&quot;<br /> <br /> He restarts the machine and drives cautiously towards the freehold","signature":"","edited":{"userid":422,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","user":"Lykas","date":". 12-08-2022, 03:52 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-09T07:34:03-08:00","id":1499216,"title":"","content":"On the way to the freehold, Halwyn comes across a car crash. Two cars, sent tumbling, police and medical on-scene.<br /> <br /> Pulling into the freehold\u2019s mini-parking lot, he can clearly see the lot is almost completely filled. The Marquesa must\u2019ve called the whole freehold in.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-09T07:39:50-08:00","id":1499218,"title":"","content":"As he drives slowly and carefully past the scene of the accident, he checks to see if he knows anyone there. Then he drive on. <br /> <br /> As he parks at the Freehold, he looks around. &quot;Is there a meeting? I didn't hear anything about it,&quot; he asks the first person he sees. &quot;Sure about the Huntsman? Right?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-09T08:04:01-08:00","id":1499220,"title":"","content":"The first fae Halwyn happens to meet is Ember. Appearing under the Mask as a charred corpse dripping wet with brine, Ember is outside smoking.<br /> <br /> \u201cHey!\u201d he says. \u201cThe man of the hour! You\u2019re just in Time, kemosabe. Everybody\u2019s been called in. And yeah, it\u2019s about the Huntsman.\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-09T08:48:33-08:00","id":1499224,"title":"","content":"He looks at his phone if he was notified. <br /> &quot;Well, at least I'm on time.&quot; He answered her. He closes his car and slowly goes to the entrance. <br /> Inside, he tries to make an overview, he knows many mostly only fleeting here. <br /> Something he wants to change.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-09T09:01:57-08:00","id":1499225,"title":"","content":"Hal Wynn gets to meet all the freeholders, save for two. The other three Seasonal monarchs are here, and, with Arcadian eyes, Halwyn sees a miraculous menagerie of changelings, from the most savage of Beasts to the most beautiful of Fairest and more. The meeting is being held out back <i>behind</i> the freehold, and barely tamed briarwolves stand sentinel, chained to their posts.<br /> <br /> The Marquesa is speaking. \u201cAlright, People, Hellhound just showed up. Who\u2019re we missing? Anyone?\u201d<br /> <br /> Someone in the crowd speaks up, saying, \u201cMountain Man!\u201d<br /> <br /> Another voice pipes up, \u201cThe Burning Man!\u201d This is greeted by contentious shouts, as rumor is the Burning Man, while clearly a monster under a Mask of some kind, may well not even BE fae.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-09T09:52:53-08:00","id":1499227,"title":"","content":"The Briarwolves create a sense of loss in him. Was he part of a pack of similar beings in Arcadia, or was he their leader? He doesn't know anymore. <br /> <br /> Halwyn blushes a little. He doesn't like being the center of attention. Slightly shy, he raises his hand when someone looks at him. <br /> The Mountain Man seemed unfamiliar to him, he certainly hadn't heard the name before. On the other hand, he has already met Burning Man once. But Halwyn can't make sense of him either. <br /> <br /> He stands a little apart, looks at the Marquessa and listens to what is being said.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-09T09:59:11-08:00","id":1499228,"title":"","content":"Leah holds up her hand. The freehold slowly falls quiet. \u201cHellhound, our Ogre friend, first encountered a herald of a Huntsman. Then Scratch encountered one a few hours ago! Then, our own Spring monarch got a visit. There\u2019s no more denying it. Huntsmen are coming.<br /> <br /> \u201cWhich is why our schedule of ritual celebrations MUST continue as planned! As long as our Bargain with the Seasons hold, the Others can\u2019t just swamp us and carry us off wholesale.<br /> <br /> \u201cAs of this moment, I\u2019m invoking the call to arms. ALL of you be wary. And if a Huntsman shows up and escape is possible, <i>run</i>. Find others. Find me. <i>Then</i>, as an impromptu motley, we\u2019ll go kick it\u2019s head in.\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-09T10:29:17-08:00","id":1499229,"title":"","content":"His eyes search for Scratch among the crowd as he hears what has been said. <br /> &quot;So he too?&quot; he murmurs. &quot;And the Spring Monarch? What's the matter, why so suddenly?&quot; His thoughts circle. <br /> Has the Herald been the same or are there more than one Huntsman on the hunt? <br /> <br /> <i>Run away</i>, something he rarely does. But it's wiser, he knows that. He later has to ask the Marquessa how he can help ensure the celebrations go as planned.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-09T11:10:44-08:00","id":1499231,"title":"","content":"The Marquesa continues, and says, \u201cHere\u2019s how we\u2019re going to do this. I\u2019m going to the local Goblin Market, try to get some useful Goblin fruits and Tokens, maybe even a Goblin Contract or two. I need at least one person to go with me.<br /> <br /> \u201cMy fellow monarchs will oversee things in my absence, but remember, <i>this is Winter</i>\u2014-MY Court has the final say. Those of you who want combat-training can, if you want, sign up for mortal self-defense classes in Lambry township, paid for by the freehold, OR, they can seek mystical combat training from certain among our own ranks.<br /> <br /> \u201cI know we\u2019re terrified, people. I know some of the younger freeholders want to bolt like rabbits. You CAN certainly do that. <i>Leaving equals exile</i>. If you abandon us in our time of need, <i>we do not need you any longer. You are thenceforth dead weight</i>. And the Huntsmen will be be MUCH happier picking off lone stragglers and runaways.<br /> <br /> \u201cWe\u2019ve already BEEN to Faerie, and we escaped. We need to fight for that freedom, now. Our Bargain still holds. This means after each kill the Huntsmen make in pursuit of us, even if it\u2019s mortals, they have to pause and mourn the death. Remember that. Use it as time to regroup with others.\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-09T12:32:35-08:00","id":1499235,"title":"","content":"Halwyn listens to the Marquessa's speech, then ponders. He can fight, but it's not trained, it's intuitive, more of a hunt for him. He can't teach anyone that. <br /> Mystical combat training sounds lovely, but starting from scratch would result in little success. <br /> The only option left to him is to follow the Marquessa and try to get supplies for a battle. <br /> Escape is not an option. <br /> <br /> He raises his hand &quot;I'll accompany you to the market if you wish.&quot; he says as the Marquessa pauses. <br /> His gaze rests resolutely on her eyes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-09T12:40:38-08:00","id":1499237,"title":"","content":"Leah nods. \u201cThank you, Hellhound. Gather what you think you\u2019ll need, then come up to Bluefingers\u2019 room. We\u2019ll be using her trod.\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-09T12:48:41-08:00","id":1499238,"title":"","content":"Halwyn nods back, then walks to his car. He thinks about what he could use. <br /> His lighter for the flames, his notebook, a gym bag that he dumps to empty and a backpack to carry things. He doesn't have much else here. <br /> <br /> He then walks towards Bluefinger's room, the book of hers in his hand to give back. He knocks briefly at the door.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-10T09:09:28-08:00","id":1499284,"title":"","content":"Upon meeting up with Leaf, she turns to face her companion. \u201cHave you heard of this Goblin Market? It\u2019s Coffin Bill\u2019s, and presents itself as a traveling circus/amusement park. Be careful what deals you make, but, if you\u2019re up to it, feel free to pick up some stuff while we\u2019re there.\u201d<br /> <br /> She sings the song-key, and Hal and Leah enter the Hedge.<br /> <br /> The Hedge has a menacing feel to it now, as eyes were watching you from all sides. The light is much dimmer, shadows everywhere. Hob-beasts, small and avian with shiny quarters for eyes watch solemnly as the two changelings pass them by.<br /> <br /> In the distance, they can hear the howl of a briarwolf.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-10T10:52:33-08:00","id":1499293,"title":"","content":"<i>Think before you speak </i> that's what Halwyn is trying to drill into himself. <br /> &quot;I'm ready when you are,&quot; he says, picking up his bags. <br /> &quot;Is there anyone I need to be particularly careful of?&quot; He thinks about what kind of stuff he could get, but also fears the costs. <br /> <br /> &quot;Is this path always like this...Do you always feel like you're on display or is it because of the Huntsmen?&quot; Like yesterday, he follows Leah's step so as not to get lost in the thorns. <br /> <br /> Though he feels the urge to answer the briar wolf, he remains silent.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-10T11:28:51-08:00","id":1499298,"title":"","content":"Leah says, \u201cThe Hedge is more than a <i>place</i>, it\u2019s also a <i>concept</i> given shape. It reflects us, especially all that\u2019s negative: Pain, fear, apprehension....its the border separating Arcadia from Earth, after all.\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-10T11:51:25-08:00","id":1499302,"title":"","content":"&quot;Okay, I see. With so much fear and paranoia among us, the hedge reacts in this way.&quot;<br /> He thinks for a moment. &quot;Do we have to hide the fact that we are looking for equipment against Huntsmen or can one say so openly and look for things in a targeted manner?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-10T12:19:29-08:00","id":1499304,"title":"","content":"\u201cWe should probably be circumspect. It\u2019s <i>incredibly</i> rare, <i>especially</i> this close to Earth, but Gentry <i>have</i> been known to appear personally in Gobli Markets. That shouldn\u2019t be the case for us....but Helldiver changelings will <i>always</i> be a threat.\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-10T12:28:54-08:00","id":1499306,"title":"","content":"<i>Helldiver</i>... Halwyn hasn't heard from them and he's starting to feel a little stupid asking a question again. Probably everyone in the freehold knows about it. <br /> &quot;How do I recognize a Helldiver? And what's so special about them? If we find one, then we can save him, can't we?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-10T14:25:23-08:00","id":1499315,"title":"","content":"Briarwolves howl in the distance. \u201cLet\u2019s get moving,\u201d Leah says.<br /> <br /> \u201cA Helldiver is a changeling slave used together things from the Hedge. They\u2019re on long leashes\u2014-sometimes <i>literally</i> though most of the time figuratively\u2014-but despite leaving Arcadia on short jaunts, they were still under a durance.\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-11T01:56:46-08:00","id":1499353,"title":"","content":"&quot;Ah okay.&quot; Replies Halwyn curtly. <br /> Changelings who still serve or must serve their masters but are still free to roam. That thought makes him shudder. So he can never be sure that his counterpart does not want something bad for him. However, if he sees a changeling on a leash, he will be even more cautious. <br /> <br /> &quot;Is the way still far?&quot; he asks, listening to the briarwolves howl. He doesn't understand what they're saying, if they're communicating at all and aren't just insane. Something else that pierces his forehead like a glowing shard of ice. In his forest he always understood his pack.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-12T10:03:12-08:00","id":1499451,"title":"","content":"[OOC: I slept not at all, last night. I\u2019m in no fit state to GM. We\u2019ll start again once I\u2019ve gotten some sleep.]","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-12T10:33:30-08:00","id":1499456,"title":"","content":"[OOC:\ud83d\udc4d\ud83c\udffc sleep well]","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-13T09:56:04-08:00","id":1499532,"title":"","content":"[OOC: Ahhhh! I slept good. Alrighty, then, let\u2019s get moving!]<br /> <br /> With the howls of briarwolves in the distance\u2014-a sad, angry, confused whine\u2014-the two head onwards, til they come across a fast-moving river with a single wooden bridge across. Sitting on a stool in front of said bridge is a huge, lumpen humanoid\u2014-with a pig\u2019s head, a ram\u2019s horns and a horse\u2019s hooves for feet. It wears mismatched clothes several sizes too small for it, and it cradles in its arms a lamppost broken free from the ground, with a chunk of concrete on one end used as a mallet.<br /> <br /> Seeing you approach, the giant heaves himself to his hooves. \u201c<b><span style=\"color:brown\">Ay. Wut we got now? A pott\u2019d plant an\u2019 a lil brother, a runt too. Pay me toll, or piss off.</span></b>\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-13T14:59:59-08:00","id":1499578,"title":"","content":"Halwyn looks at Leah. &quot;Do we pay tolls or should I beat him up?&quot; he asks confidently, cracking his neck and knuckles. The '<i>runt</i>' doesn't seem to have pleased him.<br /> <br /> Nevertheless, he is waiting for what the wintry highness announces.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-13T15:04:28-08:00","id":1499579,"title":"","content":"Leah says, \u201cAnd what is the toll?\u201d<br /> <br /> The giant smiles widely showing hideously decayed teeth. \u201c<b><span style=\"color:brown\">I needs me a toof from each a\u2019ya. Me teef is rottin\u2019. Needs me a collection of \u2018em, so I does. So some hob can put in me new teef.</span></b>\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12219,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","user":"Demigod Beast","date":". 12-17-2022, 11:52 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-14T09:42:56-08:00","id":1499655,"title":"","content":"&quot;You do not really think that I tear out a tooth,&quot; Halwyn snows at him. Then he has an idea. &quot;Your Highness, I would know something like we come past him. Without violence, without damage ... I would have to take you but piggyback.&quot; He is a little proud of his idea, but hides that he has never tried it in hedge.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-14T10:48:52-08:00","id":1499661,"title":"","content":"Leah gives him a suspicious glare.<br /> <br /> [OOC: Presence + Subterfuge, to convince her without alerting the giant to any duplicity...]","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-14T11:00:41-08:00","id":1499664,"title":"","content":"[OOC:<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bb